We'll do it.

1404
01:17:27,800 --> 01:17:29,240
Oh yeah, I almost forgot about the intro.

1405
01:17:29,420 --> 01:17:30,120
So what happened there?

1406
01:17:31,420 --> 01:17:33,640
The moat around the castle...

1407
01:17:33,640 --> 01:17:34,940
The gate was opened.

1408
01:17:35,060 --> 01:17:36,040
The drawbridge was lowered.

1409
01:17:36,200 --> 01:17:39,300
And someone evil rode off with the princess.

1410
01:17:39,500 --> 01:17:40,060
Probably Zelda.

1411
01:17:41,360 --> 01:17:43,720
And then a green creature who was definitely evil.

1412
01:17:43,960 --> 01:17:44,880
Like an orc.

1413
01:17:46,940 --> 01:17:47,740
Laughed at me.

1414
01:17:47,900 --> 01:17:49,060
And I was very shocked.

1415
01:17:50,700 --> 01:17:52,080
Oh, maybe that was the nightmare!

1416
01:17:53,580 --> 01:17:54,760
Oh, I get it now.

1417
01:17:54,900 --> 01:17:55,140
Okay.

1418
01:17:55,420 --> 01:17:56,740
I think that was my nightmare.

1419
01:17:57,660 --> 01:17:58,720
I have the courage.

1420
01:18:01,640 --> 01:18:03,740
Then enter, brave Link!

1421
01:18:04,040 --> 01:18:05,880
And thou too, Navi.

1422
01:18:07,560 --> 01:18:08,640
Navi the fairy.

1423
01:18:09,240 --> 01:18:10,540
Thou must aid, Link.

1424
01:18:11,820 --> 01:18:17,520
And Link, when Navi speaks, use up to listen well to her words of wisdom.

1425
01:18:21,920 --> 01:18:22,880
I'll do it.

1426
01:18:24,000 --> 01:18:27,740
But before I enter your mouth, let me just take a look at your left side.

1427
01:18:28,260 --> 01:18:30,640
We can't have weeds growing around you, can we now?

1428
01:18:32,000 --> 01:18:33,020
Get him out of here!

1429
01:18:34,580 --> 01:18:38,220
I cannot believe I paid 10 gold for a frickin' stick.

1430
01:18:39,500 --> 01:18:41,740
When there's ample opportunity to get them out here.

1431
01:18:42,780 --> 01:18:43,220
Whoa!

1432
01:18:47,770 --> 01:18:50,470
This statue's one-eyed gaze pierces into your mind.

1433
01:18:55,700 --> 01:18:56,620
I don't like that!

1434
01:18:58,440 --> 01:18:59,180
Boing, boing!

1435
01:18:59,480 --> 01:19:01,000
The current time is 12!

1436
01:19:06,600 --> 01:19:07,360
Excuse me?

1437
01:19:13,120 --> 01:19:13,560
Really?

1438
01:19:13,760 --> 01:19:13,920
Oh!

1439
01:19:14,940 --> 01:19:16,540
This statue's one-eyed gaze?

1440
01:19:16,680 --> 01:19:17,240
Oh, okay, okay.

1441
01:19:21,930 --> 01:19:22,370
Interesting.

1442
01:19:24,210 --> 01:19:25,810
Wait, is this guy already respawned?

1443
01:19:25,890 --> 01:19:26,330
There's no way.

1444
01:19:27,270 --> 01:19:28,490
Uh, if- Oh, check this out.

1445
01:19:29,970 --> 01:19:32,290
Oh, I didn't mean to- Actually, that was pretty good.

1446
01:19:32,910 --> 01:19:34,790
I need to do this, and then...

1447
01:19:35,470 --> 01:19:35,890
Yeah!

1448
01:19:36,250 --> 01:19:36,730
That's it.

1449
01:19:36,870 --> 01:19:37,510
The jump attack.

1450
01:19:40,230 --> 01:19:41,350
Let me enter the mouth.

1451
01:19:46,860 --> 01:19:47,920
That's a nice transition.

1452
01:19:50,080 --> 01:19:51,680
Inside the Deku Tree.

1453
01:19:54,340 --> 01:19:55,520
I will say this, though.

1454
01:19:56,020 --> 01:19:57,540
The game has great atmosphere.

1455
01:20:05,390 --> 01:20:06,290
We've got enemies.

1456
01:20:12,700 --> 01:20:13,760
Oh, scary music.

1457
01:20:13,920 --> 01:20:15,060
Oh, is that spider webs?

1458
01:20:16,200 --> 01:20:17,080
Please, no spiders.

1459
01:20:18,880 --> 01:20:20,300
And again, low-poly spiders.

1460
01:20:20,440 --> 01:20:21,180
Probably not too bad.

1461
01:20:30,150 --> 01:20:31,310
Oh, you have more HP!

1462
01:20:33,130 --> 01:20:34,130
Oh, you ain't a joke!

1463
01:20:34,270 --> 01:20:34,650
Okay, okay.

1464
01:20:34,790 --> 01:20:35,070
What's that?

1465
01:20:38,400 --> 01:20:40,060
The way I'm holding it up proudly.

1466
01:20:40,640 --> 01:20:41,700
You got a Deku Nut!

1467
01:20:42,300 --> 01:20:44,340
On the select item sub-screen, you can set it.

1468
01:20:44,580 --> 01:20:44,700
Okay.

1469
01:20:46,180 --> 01:20:47,820
Set it to C and try throwing it.

1470
01:20:48,200 --> 01:20:49,780
It will flash and stun the enemy.

1471
01:20:50,320 --> 01:20:51,440
It's a flashbang?

1472
01:20:53,060 --> 01:20:53,740
No way.

1473
01:21:01,330 --> 01:21:04,210
Oh, I thought I equipped it with that, and then I had to throw it, but okay.

1474
01:21:07,250 --> 01:21:07,890
Hey, asshole!

1475
01:21:08,650 --> 01:21:09,290
Get stunned!

1476
01:21:16,300 --> 01:21:17,480
Oh, my God.

1477
01:21:18,140 --> 01:21:18,660
Ah!

1478
01:21:26,190 --> 01:21:26,870
I'm dying!

1479
01:21:30,760 --> 01:21:31,500
Fuck you!

1480
01:21:32,440 --> 01:21:33,340
Oh, you're not dead.

1481
01:21:36,190 --> 01:21:37,310
Come on, do your attack.

1482
01:21:37,730 --> 01:21:38,070
There we go.

1483
01:21:39,670 --> 01:21:40,050
What?

1484
01:21:41,050 --> 01:21:41,550
Link!

1485
01:21:41,690 --> 01:21:42,130
What are you doing?

1486
01:21:50,890 --> 01:21:51,630
Come on!

1487
01:21:52,130 --> 01:21:53,090
Okay, there we go.

1488
01:21:53,850 --> 01:21:54,830
Oh, man.

1489
01:21:54,970 --> 01:21:55,310
We're dying.

1490
01:21:55,490 --> 01:21:55,770
We're dying.

1491
01:21:56,330 --> 01:21:57,230
We need HP.

1492
01:21:58,090 --> 01:21:58,930
Let me cut some grass.

1493
01:22:01,150 --> 01:22:03,070
No time like the present to do some gardening, right?

1494
01:22:04,290 --> 01:22:04,670
Ah!

1495
01:22:04,790 --> 01:22:04,970
Oh!

1496
01:22:05,730 --> 01:22:06,110
Okay!

1497
01:22:06,390 --> 01:22:07,230
That actually healed me.

1498
01:22:07,350 --> 01:22:08,430
I was secretly hoping for that.

1499
01:22:09,750 --> 01:22:11,510
I cannot believe that actually gave me help.

1500
01:22:12,410 --> 01:22:14,230
Okay, so now he's sort of stunned when you attack.

1501
01:22:14,590 --> 01:22:15,730
Oh, let me throw a knot at you.

1502
01:22:17,130 --> 01:22:17,610
Suck it!

1503
01:22:19,450 --> 01:22:21,150
I gotta judge the distances better here.

1504
01:22:22,190 --> 01:22:22,570
Okay!

1505
01:22:22,790 --> 01:22:23,210
Oh, my God.

1506
01:22:23,250 --> 01:22:27,070
I can't believe there were these evil enemies growing inside of the Deku Tree.

1507
01:22:28,950 --> 01:22:30,490
Oh, that's a spider web for sure.

1508
01:22:31,790 --> 01:22:32,720
Wait, what if I...

1509
01:22:33,430 --> 01:22:34,190
Check this out.

1510
01:22:35,190 --> 01:22:35,610
No?

1511
01:22:36,670 --> 01:22:37,230
Cut it!

1512
01:22:43,860 --> 01:22:44,320
Okay.

1513
01:22:47,020 --> 01:22:47,880
Let's climb up.

1514
01:22:48,560 --> 01:22:49,020
Cheers!

1515
01:22:54,900 --> 01:22:55,500
Oh, yeah.

1516
01:22:57,260 --> 01:22:57,900
Oh, yeah.

1517
01:23:00,180 --> 01:23:01,440
Such calming music now.

1518
01:23:03,840 --> 01:23:04,420
Oh, wait.

1519
01:23:04,640 --> 01:23:06,200
This is the way you do it, and then you look up.

1520
01:23:10,010 --> 01:23:11,330
Is that...

1521
01:23:11,330 --> 01:23:13,090
That's a spider!

1522
01:23:15,190 --> 01:23:16,330
Oh, no.

1523
01:23:17,650 --> 01:23:18,970
I mean...

1524
01:23:18,970 --> 01:23:19,950
It's not...

1525
01:23:19,950 --> 01:23:20,030
Oh.

1526
01:23:20,410 --> 01:23:22,690
Do I actually just walk off here, or...

1527
01:23:22,690 --> 01:23:23,890
Can I trust the jump?

1528
01:23:24,110 --> 01:23:26,050
Okay, I can definitely trust it.

1529
01:23:30,990 --> 01:23:31,320
Oh!

1530
01:23:31,720 --> 01:23:32,620
Absorbs my fall.

1531
01:23:33,760 --> 01:23:35,880
Really well done, actually, for...

1532
01:23:35,880 --> 01:23:37,520
An N64 game.

1533
01:23:38,560 --> 01:23:39,920
Then again, I mean...

1534
01:23:40,440 --> 01:23:44,760
The one game I always associated with Nintendo 64, that I played as a kid...

1535
01:23:44,760 --> 01:23:46,080
Was, uh...

1536
01:23:46,080 --> 01:23:47,000
Super Mario 64.

1537
01:23:47,980 --> 01:23:48,460
And...

1538
01:23:48,460 --> 01:23:50,440
Lilat Wars, or as you know it in the US.

1539
01:23:50,620 --> 01:23:51,140
Star Fox!

1540
01:23:52,600 --> 01:23:53,940
And GoldenEye, of course.

1541
01:23:55,820 --> 01:23:56,300
Uh...

1542
01:23:56,300 --> 01:23:57,360
Cut that!

1543
01:23:59,920 --> 01:24:00,340
Nice.

1544
01:24:02,700 --> 01:24:04,060
Slowly approaching, uh...

1545
01:24:04,060 --> 01:24:04,640
Former riches.

1546
01:24:04,900 --> 01:24:05,380
Uh-oh.

1547
01:24:07,640 --> 01:24:08,480
I see them.

1548
01:24:13,050 --> 01:24:13,650
Hey, dude!

1549
01:24:14,850 --> 01:24:15,430
Oh, shit.

1550
01:24:16,470 --> 01:24:16,890
Uh...

1551
01:24:17,690 --> 01:24:18,110
What?

1552
01:24:18,690 --> 01:24:20,170
I thought I would throw the nut at it!

1553
01:24:21,090 --> 01:24:21,510
Uh...

1554
01:24:21,510 --> 01:24:21,730
Hmm.

1555
01:24:24,230 --> 01:24:25,570
What is the stick good for, though?

1556
01:24:25,650 --> 01:24:27,450
Why would I ever use a stick when I have...

1557
01:24:27,450 --> 01:24:28,430
My sword?

1558
01:24:30,070 --> 01:24:31,310
Are you gonna jump down?

1559
01:24:31,670 --> 01:24:32,030
Uh-oh.

1560
01:24:33,190 --> 01:24:33,870
Look at this wall!

1561
01:24:34,210 --> 01:24:35,390
The vine's growing on it.

1562
01:24:35,450 --> 01:24:36,410
Give it a rough surface.

1563
01:24:37,350 --> 01:24:38,490
Maybe you can climb it.

1564
01:24:38,530 --> 01:24:38,790
Link!

1565
01:24:40,190 --> 01:24:41,150
Okay, I will try.

1566
01:24:42,250 --> 01:24:42,650
No!

1567
01:24:43,110 --> 01:24:44,550
Don't fucking throw that!

1568
01:24:44,770 --> 01:24:46,470
Oh, this is gonna take a while for me to get used to.

1569
01:24:49,700 --> 01:24:50,360
I'm climbing.

1570
01:24:54,640 --> 01:24:55,440
Oh, no.

1571
01:24:57,440 --> 01:24:59,360
Dude, this is actually making me sweat a little bit.

1572
01:24:59,480 --> 01:25:00,260
I hate spiders.

1573
01:25:07,200 --> 01:25:08,140
I can't attack!

1574
01:25:09,440 --> 01:25:10,540
Okay, just go, just go.

1575
01:25:10,640 --> 01:25:11,360
It's going back.

1576
01:25:11,560 --> 01:25:11,880
It's going back.

1577
01:25:14,320 --> 01:25:15,480
Ah, no!

1578
01:25:17,350 --> 01:25:18,510
Oh, my God!

1579
01:25:19,650 --> 01:25:20,450
Wait, there's a chest here.

1580
01:25:25,300 --> 01:25:26,900
Let it be an anti-spider item.

1581
01:25:30,790 --> 01:25:32,430
You found the dungeon map!

1582
01:25:33,150 --> 01:25:35,650
Press start to get into the subscreen and look at it.

1583
01:25:37,410 --> 01:25:39,910
Blue chambers are places you've already visited.

1584
01:25:40,490 --> 01:25:42,690
Your current location is the flashing room.

1585
01:25:43,490 --> 01:25:43,830
Okay.

1586
01:25:46,450 --> 01:25:49,190
Move stick up and down to select the floor to view.

1587
01:25:51,350 --> 01:25:52,010
All right.

1588
01:26:02,430 --> 01:26:04,030
Okay, so that's where I am now.

1589
01:26:06,250 --> 01:26:07,170
There's a basement!

1590
01:26:12,820 --> 01:26:13,260
Okay.

1591
01:26:15,880 --> 01:26:17,280
Yeah, well, we just gotta go up.

1592
01:26:17,540 --> 01:26:18,300
Also, let me save.

1593
01:26:19,840 --> 01:26:20,280
Yes.

1594
01:26:21,040 --> 01:26:21,760
Save the game.

1595
01:26:23,440 --> 01:26:24,300
A to dis...

1596
01:26:24,300 --> 01:26:24,960
Okay, okay, okay.

1597
01:26:27,260 --> 01:26:27,580
Oof.

1598
01:26:28,040 --> 01:26:28,240
All right.

1599
01:26:31,980 --> 01:26:33,280
Dude, how do I avoid this?

1600
01:26:36,120 --> 01:26:36,760
Maybe, maybe...

1601
01:26:36,760 --> 01:26:38,100
Can I...

1602
01:26:38,820 --> 01:26:39,820
Change the camera angle?

1603
01:26:40,000 --> 01:26:40,240
Oh!

1604
01:26:42,460 --> 01:26:42,780
Motherfucker!

1605
01:26:42,920 --> 01:26:43,700
How are you supposed to do this?

1606
01:26:44,760 --> 01:26:45,480
Wait a minute, what's...

1607
01:26:45,880 --> 01:26:46,360
What's happening?

1608
01:26:49,440 --> 01:26:50,660
Okay, I see where I need to go.

1609
01:26:57,360 --> 01:26:58,520
Oh, wait, there's a door over here.

1610
01:26:59,440 --> 01:27:00,500
Let me check that out first.

1611
01:27:06,420 --> 01:27:06,860
Listen.

1612
01:27:07,480 --> 01:27:10,160
You can open a door by standing in front of it and pressing A.

1613
01:27:11,520 --> 01:27:14,400
Pay attention to what the action icon says.

1614
01:27:15,060 --> 01:27:17,100
That's the blue icon at the top of the screen.

1615
01:27:18,100 --> 01:27:19,100
I'm paying attention.

1616
01:27:22,710 --> 01:27:23,250
Uh-oh.

1617
01:27:24,490 --> 01:27:25,790
Why do I get boss fight vibes?

1618
01:27:27,870 --> 01:27:29,290
Oh, he's shooting nuts at me!

1619
01:27:33,030 --> 01:27:33,970
The hell are you?

1620
01:27:35,590 --> 01:27:37,010
All right, shoot your shot.

1621
01:27:41,290 --> 01:27:41,730
A!

1622
01:27:41,730 --> 01:27:42,450
Hey, we got it.

1623
01:27:45,390 --> 01:27:45,710
Hoi!

1624
01:27:46,550 --> 01:27:47,150
Oh my god.

1625
01:27:47,290 --> 01:27:48,550
Okay, I need to be faster here.

1626
01:27:48,710 --> 01:27:48,990
Maybe now.

1627
01:27:49,650 --> 01:27:49,950
Come on.

1628
01:27:53,260 --> 01:27:54,260
Oh, you're fast, eh?

1629
01:28:02,140 --> 01:28:02,820
Oh, you little...

1630
01:28:05,360 --> 01:28:05,680
Eh.

1631
01:28:11,240 --> 01:28:11,860
Get out of the way.

1632
01:28:13,940 --> 01:28:14,540
Wait, what's this?

1633
01:28:16,760 --> 01:28:17,360
Deku scrub.

1634
01:28:18,120 --> 01:28:20,240
It will hide in the grass if you get close to it.

1635
01:28:20,900 --> 01:28:22,580
Bounce the nuts it spits back at it.

1636
01:28:23,580 --> 01:28:23,880
Oh!

1637
01:28:24,900 --> 01:28:25,200
Shield?

1638
01:28:26,780 --> 01:28:27,080
Hey!

1639
01:28:28,880 --> 01:28:29,580
Oh, wait a minute.

1640
01:28:29,700 --> 01:28:31,080
I think I know you from Breath of the Wild.

1641
01:28:32,500 --> 01:28:33,080
Ow, ow, ow.

1642
01:28:33,460 --> 01:28:34,140
Forgive me, master.

1643
01:28:34,420 --> 01:28:36,040
If I give you a clue, will you let me go?

1644
01:28:37,060 --> 01:28:37,360
Hmm.

1645
01:28:38,120 --> 01:28:39,300
Make it two clues.

1646
01:28:40,860 --> 01:28:46,180
When you jump above a high cliff, if you hold stick forward, you'll roll on the ground when you land.

1647
01:28:46,560 --> 01:28:48,240
I won't get hurt from the fall.

1648
01:28:49,740 --> 01:28:50,180
Thanks.

1649
01:28:51,120 --> 01:28:52,600
I can't guarantee it will work, though.

1650
01:28:52,600 --> 01:28:54,820
Oh, if the cliff is really, really high.

1651
01:28:56,140 --> 01:28:58,680
Well, try it if you're feeling cold.

1652
01:29:02,610 --> 01:29:03,670
Where am I?

1653
01:29:09,650 --> 01:29:11,090
Okay, I can go that way now?

1654
01:29:12,670 --> 01:29:13,230
Wait.

1655
01:29:14,130 --> 01:29:15,410
I see climbing.

1656
01:29:17,090 --> 01:29:18,010
Oh, never mind.

1657
01:29:20,770 --> 01:29:21,750
Doesn't that look rough?

1658
01:29:21,950 --> 01:29:22,890
That looks rough to me, kinda.

1659
01:29:23,570 --> 01:29:24,410
That's kinda rough, right?

1660
01:29:25,270 --> 01:29:25,710
No?

1661
01:29:25,950 --> 01:29:26,250
Okay.

1662
01:29:34,820 --> 01:29:35,920
We dungeoning now.

1663
01:29:36,040 --> 01:29:36,540
Look at this.

1664
01:29:37,140 --> 01:29:38,500
Oh, I see stuff down here.

1665
01:29:38,560 --> 01:29:40,660
I gotta go cut that up.

1666
01:29:41,640 --> 01:29:42,500
Get the money.

1667
01:29:46,330 --> 01:29:46,770
Easy.

1668
01:29:47,030 --> 01:29:47,730
Now that's rough.

1669
01:29:48,470 --> 01:29:48,910
Yeah.

1670
01:29:51,790 --> 01:29:52,570
Not bad.

1671
01:29:55,210 --> 01:29:56,610
Why is there a creepy eye?

1672
01:30:00,850 --> 01:30:01,930
What is that symbol?

1673
01:30:04,550 --> 01:30:05,590
Is this a trap?

1674
01:30:12,960 --> 01:30:13,480
Ah.

1675
01:30:14,440 --> 01:30:14,960
Nice.

1676
01:30:16,300 --> 01:30:18,300
Oh my god, it's the fairy slingshot!

1677
01:30:19,340 --> 01:30:20,700
It's what I've been waiting for.

1678
01:30:23,820 --> 01:30:24,620
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

1679
01:30:24,660 --> 01:30:25,020
I understand.

1680
01:30:25,260 --> 01:30:28,880
As you hold, see, you can aim with stick.

1681
01:30:30,620 --> 01:30:32,500
Release to unleash a Deku seed.

1682
01:30:33,420 --> 01:30:35,640
Oh, this is how we're gonna take care of the spiders!

