3648
03:22:32,790 --> 03:22:33,030
Okay.

3649
03:22:34,350 --> 03:22:36,230
Oh, I didn't realize there was a human!

3650
03:22:36,450 --> 03:22:38,230
I thought it was like a piece of armor!

3651
03:22:38,990 --> 03:22:39,890
I'm so sorry.

3652
03:22:41,950 --> 03:22:44,330
Man, I am so bored.

3653
03:22:45,170 --> 03:22:47,990
Things would sure be more interesting if there were more...

3654
03:22:47,990 --> 03:22:49,470
Troubles in the world.

3655
03:22:51,610 --> 03:22:53,710
Hey, that's just between you and me, okay?

3656
03:22:54,850 --> 03:22:57,470
Anyway, maybe we can let off some steam by...

3657
03:22:58,130 --> 03:22:58,670
Breaking these jars!

3658
03:23:00,050 --> 03:23:02,470
Stand near a jar and press A to lift it.

3659
03:23:02,870 --> 03:23:04,190
Press A again to toss it.

3660
03:23:04,810 --> 03:23:05,890
I know that!

3661
03:23:05,890 --> 03:23:05,990
What?

3662
03:23:06,530 --> 03:23:07,830
Who do you think I am?

3663
03:23:08,050 --> 03:23:08,710
An amateur?

3664
03:23:09,490 --> 03:23:10,810
I am Link!

3665
03:23:13,940 --> 03:23:14,980
Hero of this world!

3666
03:23:15,540 --> 03:23:16,340
Wait a second.

3667
03:23:19,340 --> 03:23:20,360
Climb up here.

3668
03:23:33,510 --> 03:23:34,170
Yeah!

3669
03:23:35,410 --> 03:23:37,890
No jar shall escape my gaze.

3670
03:23:38,670 --> 03:23:39,330
Oh, crap.

3671
03:23:45,990 --> 03:23:46,710
Sir!

3672
03:23:46,990 --> 03:23:48,030
You cannot be real.

3673
03:23:56,470 --> 03:23:56,890
Yeah!

3674
03:23:58,810 --> 03:24:00,630
You may ask yourself, why did I do that?

3675
03:24:01,350 --> 03:24:01,910
Why not?

3676
03:24:03,250 --> 03:24:03,850
That's the answer.

3677
03:24:03,950 --> 03:24:05,170
Maybe I can flashbang this guy.

3678
03:24:06,530 --> 03:24:06,930
Boom!

3679
03:24:08,210 --> 03:24:09,050
Did that scare ya?

3680
03:24:11,510 --> 03:24:12,650
Did not scare ya, okay.

3681
03:24:13,830 --> 03:24:14,230
Alright!

3682
03:24:16,270 --> 03:24:17,350
I'll see you later, dude.

3683
03:24:18,050 --> 03:24:19,550
Hopefully a criminal comes your way.

3684
03:24:20,370 --> 03:24:21,470
Because you want it to happen.

3685
03:24:21,670 --> 03:24:22,250
You want it to happen.

3686
03:24:22,430 --> 03:24:23,650
I'm not actually wishing that.

3687
03:24:24,670 --> 03:24:25,890
From some ill place.

3688
03:24:29,770 --> 03:24:30,170
Market.

3689
03:24:31,210 --> 03:24:32,070
Oh my god.

3690
03:24:32,530 --> 03:24:33,450
That looks awesome!

3691
03:24:33,510 --> 03:24:34,190
We're gonna explore it!

3692
03:24:34,330 --> 03:24:35,030
But not yet.

3693
03:24:35,230 --> 03:24:35,970
We're taking a break.

3694
03:24:36,330 --> 03:24:37,370
I'll see you in five minutes.

3695
03:29:57,470 --> 03:29:58,310
We are back.

3696
03:29:59,570 --> 03:30:00,270
Here we are.

3697
03:30:01,030 --> 03:30:02,670
I am in Hyrule Castle.

3698
03:30:02,970 --> 03:30:04,430
And things are popping off.

3699
03:30:04,510 --> 03:30:05,670
Look how happy everyone is.

3700
03:30:06,190 --> 03:30:06,970
Just like me.

3701
03:30:07,330 --> 03:30:07,990
They're drinking.

3702
03:30:08,350 --> 03:30:09,210
They're being jolly.

3703
03:30:09,450 --> 03:30:10,990
Just having a good time on this Friday.

3704
03:30:11,710 --> 03:30:12,990
Is my character dancing?

3705
03:30:14,190 --> 03:30:15,310
Oh no, he was stretching.

3706
03:30:15,470 --> 03:30:15,610
Okay.

3707
03:30:18,170 --> 03:30:19,010
Very nice.

3708
03:30:20,670 --> 03:30:22,090
Okay, let's explore this.

3709
03:30:23,530 --> 03:30:25,150
Oh, I can't change camera angle.

3710
03:30:26,650 --> 03:30:27,430
Oh, oh.

3711
03:30:29,390 --> 03:30:30,150
Wait a minute.

3712
03:30:30,750 --> 03:30:31,470
Huff, huff!

3713
03:30:31,710 --> 03:30:32,370
I'm late!

3714
03:30:32,470 --> 03:30:32,710
I'm late!

3715
03:30:32,910 --> 03:30:34,250
For a very important date!

3716
03:30:36,470 --> 03:30:38,430
Why does it look like you're one of those thieves?

3717
03:30:38,670 --> 03:30:40,510
With like a little money bag running away.

3718
03:30:41,630 --> 03:30:42,850
That's what you look like.

3719
03:30:45,940 --> 03:30:46,300
What?

3720
03:30:47,220 --> 03:30:48,540
What a crazy guy!

3721
03:30:49,880 --> 03:30:56,060
Can you believe this guy was crazy enough to try to sneak into the castle to see Princess Zelda?

3722
03:30:57,540 --> 03:30:59,520
All because of this idiot!

3723
03:30:59,920 --> 03:31:01,980
They've tightened security at the castle!

3724
03:31:02,340 --> 03:31:02,720
Hahaha!

3725
03:31:04,280 --> 03:31:04,680
Okay.

3726
03:31:05,780 --> 03:31:07,160
Yeah, that is kind of stupid.

3727
03:31:08,040 --> 03:31:10,160
Who would want to do such a thing?

3728
03:31:10,840 --> 03:31:12,480
Why is everyone over here?

3729
03:31:12,560 --> 03:31:12,900
What's happening?

3730
03:31:14,080 --> 03:31:15,040
What's going on?

3731
03:31:19,310 --> 03:31:20,730
Something is very popular here.

3732
03:31:21,210 --> 03:31:21,850
Sir?

3733
03:31:25,760 --> 03:31:27,800
This beard is my pride and joy.

3734
03:31:28,720 --> 03:31:30,360
Doesn't it look luxuriant, kid?

3735
03:31:32,480 --> 03:31:34,060
I'll give it a...

3736
03:31:34,060 --> 03:31:34,360
I don't know.

3737
03:31:34,920 --> 03:31:35,340
Six...

3738
03:31:35,340 --> 03:31:36,160
Seven out of ten?

3739
03:31:38,040 --> 03:31:38,740
Can I go inside?

3740
03:31:43,430 --> 03:31:44,110
Oh, wait a minute.

3741
03:31:44,190 --> 03:31:44,830
This guy is a...

3742
03:31:45,330 --> 03:31:45,750
Gorok.

3743
03:31:45,970 --> 03:31:46,370
Right?

3744
03:31:49,110 --> 03:31:55,150
I heard a rumor that there is a monster that eats Hylian Shield somewhere out there in the world.

3745
03:31:55,810 --> 03:31:57,130
Have you ever seen it?

3746
03:31:57,830 --> 03:31:58,830
I haven't.

3747
03:32:02,630 --> 03:32:03,190
Welcome.

3748
03:32:03,370 --> 03:32:04,390
I love his face.

3749
03:32:04,710 --> 03:32:06,770
There's so much personality in that.

3750
03:32:09,050 --> 03:32:10,450
Okay, so you're selling things.

3751
03:32:10,590 --> 03:32:10,970
What do you sell?

3752
03:32:12,910 --> 03:32:13,910
Hylian Shield!

3753
03:32:13,910 --> 03:32:14,530
Yo!

3754
03:32:15,910 --> 03:32:19,470
This is a big heavy shield, just like the ones Hylian Knights use.

3755
03:32:19,950 --> 03:32:21,630
It can stand up to flame attacks.

3756
03:32:22,270 --> 03:32:23,050
Now that's...

3757
03:32:23,050 --> 03:32:23,710
wonderful.

3758
03:32:23,970 --> 03:32:24,750
Because mine doesn't.

3759
03:32:26,470 --> 03:32:29,170
Deku Nuts, and of course arrows, and a stick.

3760
03:32:29,330 --> 03:32:29,650
Gotcha.

3761
03:32:29,810 --> 03:32:29,970
Okay.

3762
03:32:33,100 --> 03:32:33,880
Very nice.

3763
03:32:36,800 --> 03:32:38,160
We need a little bit more money.

3764
03:32:39,560 --> 03:32:40,280
Oh, look!

3765
03:32:40,360 --> 03:32:40,820
They're in love.

3766
03:32:42,320 --> 03:32:42,800
Oh!

3767
03:32:43,900 --> 03:32:44,960
You are...

3768
03:32:44,960 --> 03:32:46,060
so handsome.

3769
03:32:47,280 --> 03:32:49,140
Just like the king of Hyrule.

3770
03:32:50,240 --> 03:32:50,960
He he he.

3771
03:32:52,040 --> 03:32:53,260
Ha ha ha ha ha ha.

3772
03:32:54,300 --> 03:32:54,680
Alright.

3773
03:32:56,260 --> 03:32:56,920
Ma'am?

3774
03:32:59,120 --> 03:33:00,960
I can't catch that cuckoo!

3775
03:33:01,240 --> 03:33:02,700
Oh wait, I'm talking to a child.

3776
03:33:04,220 --> 03:33:05,560
Oh, let me help you with that.

3777
03:33:09,880 --> 03:33:10,700
I got you.

3778
03:33:11,300 --> 03:33:12,120
I got you.

3779
03:33:13,020 --> 03:33:13,460
Come here.

3780
03:33:14,480 --> 03:33:15,280
Oh my god.

3781
03:33:22,080 --> 03:33:23,020
There we go.

3782
03:33:23,280 --> 03:33:23,920
Nope.

3783
03:33:24,360 --> 03:33:24,880
Wrong one.

3784
03:33:26,500 --> 03:33:27,000
Ah!

3785
03:33:29,500 --> 03:33:30,140
Cuckoo!

3786
03:33:35,220 --> 03:33:35,860
What?

3787
03:33:37,560 --> 03:33:38,560
Am I supposed...

3788
03:33:38,560 --> 03:33:39,680
Am I gonna slay it?

3789
03:33:41,460 --> 03:33:42,680
I mean, I guess I could.

3790
03:33:43,620 --> 03:33:44,180
Hey!

3791
03:33:44,960 --> 03:33:45,600
Cuckoo!

3792
03:33:49,980 --> 03:33:50,560
I just...

3793
03:33:50,560 --> 03:33:51,200
Ha ha ha!

3794
03:33:51,380 --> 03:33:51,600
Geez!

3795
03:33:51,880 --> 03:33:53,300
I'm terrible at this!

3796
03:33:54,400 --> 03:33:55,040
Ah!

3797
03:33:55,300 --> 03:33:55,740
Fine!

3798
03:33:56,100 --> 03:33:56,520
Alright.

3799
03:33:57,020 --> 03:33:58,840
What the hell is happening here?

3800
03:34:00,840 --> 03:34:01,480
Please!

3801
03:34:01,880 --> 03:34:02,580
With C!

3802
03:34:03,180 --> 03:34:04,180
Please sell me something!

3803
03:34:04,500 --> 03:34:04,900
Please!

3804
03:34:05,180 --> 03:34:05,660
With C!

3805
03:34:06,620 --> 03:34:07,460
Ha ha ha ha!

3806
03:34:09,500 --> 03:34:10,140
Uh...

3807
03:34:14,200 --> 03:34:14,660
Okay.

3808
03:34:17,260 --> 03:34:17,900
I...

3809
03:34:17,900 --> 03:34:18,780
What?

3810
03:34:21,710 --> 03:34:23,050
How do I s...

3811
03:34:27,130 --> 03:34:27,730
Oh!

3812
03:34:27,950 --> 03:34:28,970
No, I didn't mean to play.

3813
03:34:31,230 --> 03:34:32,230
I can't...

3814
03:34:32,230 --> 03:34:32,950
I can't sell you!

3815
03:34:35,760 --> 03:34:37,100
I don't understand.

3816
03:34:38,160 --> 03:34:39,240
They're grayed out.

3817
03:34:40,160 --> 03:34:41,860
I was gonna sell you some nuts.

3818
03:34:45,330 --> 03:34:45,930
Ma'am?

3819
03:34:48,780 --> 03:34:53,240
Do you know about the Temple of Time that we have in the northeast part of town?

3820
03:34:54,100 --> 03:34:55,240
I don't actually.

3821
03:34:55,380 --> 03:34:55,800
Tell me more.

3822
03:34:57,040 --> 03:35:01,340
Legends say that the Temple of Time is the entrance to the Sacred Realm.

3823
03:35:02,160 --> 03:35:02,420
Oh!

3824
03:35:03,320 --> 03:35:04,500
With the Triforce.

3825
03:35:04,940 --> 03:35:05,840
Did you know that?

3826
03:35:06,240 --> 03:35:07,400
I didn't know that.

3827
03:35:07,540 --> 03:35:07,860
Thank you.

3828
03:35:09,040 --> 03:35:10,940
Man, people are really loving their shopping here.

3829
03:35:12,020 --> 03:35:13,560
Let me do some gardening for y'all.

3830
03:35:14,300 --> 03:35:14,700
Oh!

3831
03:35:14,760 --> 03:35:15,060
I'm sorry!

3832
03:35:15,660 --> 03:35:16,400
Oh, I thought I hit the guy.

3833
03:35:16,500 --> 03:35:16,820
I hit the tree.

3834
03:35:17,060 --> 03:35:17,180
Okay.

3835
03:35:18,480 --> 03:35:19,460
Getting some money here.

3836
03:35:22,560 --> 03:35:22,960
Um...

3837
03:35:22,960 --> 03:35:24,080
There's also a door over here.

3838
03:35:24,260 --> 03:35:25,160
Also, let me talk to this woman.

3839
03:35:27,840 --> 03:35:28,240
Kid!

3840
03:35:28,680 --> 03:35:30,480
Have you been to Lon Lon Ranch?

3841
03:35:31,820 --> 03:35:33,380
Their milk is delicious!

3842
03:35:34,160 --> 03:35:36,180
There are many horses there and...

3843
03:35:36,180 --> 03:35:38,660
The young daughter of the ranch owner is cute!

3844
03:35:39,700 --> 03:35:40,920
Is that so?

3845
03:35:41,620 --> 03:35:44,820
But are we talking, uh, Saria's level of cute?

3846
03:35:45,660 --> 03:35:46,580
Or what?

3847
03:35:47,460 --> 03:35:51,820
To get to Lon Lon Ranch after you leave town, head due south across the field.

3848
03:35:52,200 --> 03:35:54,340
You should visit the ranch at least once.

3849
03:35:55,380 --> 03:35:56,020
Okay.

3850
03:35:56,640 --> 03:35:58,540
Milk and hotties.

3851
03:35:58,860 --> 03:36:01,960
Sounds like an opening scene out of a Tarantino movie.

3852
03:36:03,540 --> 03:36:04,700
Potion shop.

3853
03:36:04,880 --> 03:36:05,500
Potion seller!

3854
03:36:06,020 --> 03:36:06,200
Potion seller!

3855
03:36:06,200 --> 03:36:08,120
I require your strongest potion.

3856
03:36:08,900 --> 03:36:09,820
Welcome!

3857
03:36:11,620 --> 03:36:12,540
What do you have?

3858
03:36:13,600 --> 03:36:14,520
Green potion.

3859
03:36:15,540 --> 03:36:17,460
Drink to recover your magic power?

3860
03:36:17,900 --> 03:36:19,700
This is just a single dose.

3861
03:36:20,620 --> 03:36:21,480
There's magic?

3862
03:36:22,740 --> 03:36:23,540
Life energy?

3863
03:36:24,580 --> 03:36:25,900
Fairy spirit.

3864
03:36:26,620 --> 03:36:28,520
You need an empty bottle to put it in.

3865
03:36:28,760 --> 03:36:30,100
Don't go into battle without it.

3866
03:36:30,800 --> 03:36:31,080
Hahaha.

3867
03:36:32,920 --> 03:36:33,220
Okay.

3868
03:36:33,960 --> 03:36:35,800
Use it to feel refreshing coolness?

3869
03:36:36,820 --> 03:36:37,380
What?

3870
03:36:38,900 --> 03:36:39,460
Okay.

3871
03:36:41,780 --> 03:36:42,840
Is that a spider?

3872
03:36:43,300 --> 03:36:43,940
Bottle bug.

3873
03:36:44,940 --> 03:36:47,080
Uh, it looks like just an ordinary bug.

3874
03:36:47,420 --> 03:36:47,680
Alright.

3875
03:36:48,280 --> 03:36:49,160
And a fish.

3876
03:36:49,440 --> 03:36:50,520
200 rupees?

3877
03:36:51,540 --> 03:36:53,020
Just caught and so fresh.

3878
03:36:53,360 --> 03:36:54,580
You can keep it in a bottle.

3879
03:36:55,780 --> 03:36:56,160
Uh-huh.

3880
03:36:56,980 --> 03:36:57,680
And a po?

3881
03:36:58,780 --> 03:37:00,540
This is a bottle of ghost spirit.

3882
03:37:01,280 --> 03:37:03,760
Sell it to someone who is crazy about weird things like this.

3883
03:37:06,680 --> 03:37:07,480
You know what?

3884
03:37:07,740 --> 03:37:09,140
I'll be back later for that.

3885
03:37:10,380 --> 03:37:11,620
Let me go break your pot.

3886
03:37:12,480 --> 03:37:13,320
Oh, I can't.

3887
03:37:13,420 --> 03:37:13,920
Okay, okay.

3888
03:37:15,640 --> 03:37:16,120
Sir.

3889
03:37:17,020 --> 03:37:22,540
There's a rumor going around that there's a potion shop that can make the ultimate medicine.

3890
03:37:24,520 --> 03:37:25,520
Is that so?

3891
03:37:27,960 --> 03:37:29,460
Care to tell me where that is?

3892
03:37:31,100 --> 03:37:31,620
Nope.

3893
03:37:31,860 --> 03:37:32,160
Okay.

3894
03:37:33,060 --> 03:37:33,920
I'm out of here.

3895
03:37:36,280 --> 03:37:38,540
I like that you can see the signs above these doors.

3896
03:37:40,040 --> 03:37:42,500
Like, that's clearly like a potion shop now.

3897
03:37:43,220 --> 03:37:43,560
Ma'am.

3898
03:37:45,040 --> 03:37:49,920
My precious puppy can run faster than any of the other mutts around here.

3899
03:37:51,560 --> 03:37:53,020
I think you're lying.

3900
03:37:55,200 --> 03:37:55,840
Okay.

3901
03:37:56,300 --> 03:37:58,140
They will never say something twice.

3902
03:37:58,460 --> 03:37:59,920
I mean, say something new.

3903
03:38:00,200 --> 03:38:01,900
So they always repeat themselves.

3904
03:38:02,720 --> 03:38:03,640
Are those butterflies?

3905
03:38:07,820 --> 03:38:08,460
Okay.

3906
03:38:10,700 --> 03:38:13,760
Judging by the sign above, this is a butt store?

3907
03:38:14,700 --> 03:38:16,040
I'm not sure what that is.

3908
03:38:16,120 --> 03:38:16,680
I can't tell.

3909
03:38:19,360 --> 03:38:21,440
Oh, happy mask shop.

3910
03:38:24,900 --> 03:38:27,100
Please read the sign before you use the shop.

3911
03:38:28,600 --> 03:38:29,720
How this shop works.

3912
03:38:30,080 --> 03:38:32,000
We do not sell masks at the shop.

3913
03:38:32,340 --> 03:38:34,000
We just lend them to you.

3914
03:38:35,000 --> 03:38:35,420
Uh-huh.

3915
03:38:36,160 --> 03:38:38,080
You sell the loaned masks on your own.

3916
03:38:41,790 --> 03:38:42,350
What?

3917
03:38:44,210 --> 03:38:47,770
You pay back the money for the mask and we will lend you a newer model.

3918
03:38:50,580 --> 03:38:53,060
You can borrow masks you have already sold again.

3919
03:38:53,860 --> 03:38:56,660
However, you can sell each model of a mask only once.

3920
03:38:58,120 --> 03:38:59,320
Please try our shop.

3921
03:39:01,280 --> 03:39:01,840
What?

3922
03:39:03,640 --> 03:39:05,300
Bro, you gotta explain this to me.

3923
03:39:06,440 --> 03:39:08,040
What a strange shop.

3924
03:39:08,500 --> 03:39:10,620
I wonder when it'll be open for business.

3925
03:39:11,100 --> 03:39:13,020
I read the sign there, but...

3926
03:39:13,020 --> 03:39:13,880
It still seems weird.

3927
03:39:14,380 --> 03:39:14,940
Right?

3928
03:39:15,380 --> 03:39:16,480
That's what I thought.

3929
03:39:17,960 --> 03:39:19,200
Weird ass shop.

3930
