I just realized.

3956
03:40:26,160 --> 03:40:27,240
What the hell does that mean?

3957
03:40:32,640 --> 03:40:33,580
9.05.

3958
03:40:33,860 --> 03:40:34,000
Okay.

3959
03:40:34,340 --> 03:40:35,380
Is it the same for everyone?

3960
03:40:39,590 --> 03:40:40,470
9.05.

3961
03:40:44,070 --> 03:40:44,550
Ha!

3962
03:40:45,270 --> 03:40:45,750
Alright.

3963
03:40:47,390 --> 03:40:49,010
Boing boing!

3964
03:40:49,010 --> 03:40:49,750
Boing boing!

3965
03:40:52,550 --> 03:40:54,810
Man, this looks nice.

3966
03:40:56,150 --> 03:40:57,590
What a vibe.

3967
03:41:05,470 --> 03:41:06,930
The Temple of Time.

3968
03:41:13,550 --> 03:41:15,090
So majestic.

3969
03:41:25,330 --> 03:41:25,870
Cool.

3970
03:41:59,510 --> 03:42:00,870
uahhh...

3971
03:42:00,870 --> 03:42:01,470
uahhh!

3972
03:42:02,150 --> 03:42:02,790
Uahhh!

3973
03:42:10,910 --> 03:42:12,950
Oh my god, I nailed it!

3974
03:42:13,950 --> 03:42:15,990
Wee-hoo, wee-hoo...

3975
03:42:15,990 --> 03:42:17,690
Oh wait, that's Game of Thrones.

3976
03:42:19,110 --> 03:42:19,750
Whoops.

3977
03:42:21,170 --> 03:42:22,250
I messed it up.

3978
03:42:27,350 --> 03:42:30,730
There are three hollows and an inscription here.

3979
03:42:32,870 --> 03:42:39,990
Ye who owns three spiritual stones, stand with the Ocarina of Time and play the Song of Time.

3980
03:42:43,900 --> 03:42:46,060
That is how the inscription reads.

3981
03:42:47,500 --> 03:42:48,080
Got it.

3982
03:42:49,180 --> 03:42:51,080
So we do have to play a song in here.

3983
03:42:55,840 --> 03:42:56,980
The Song of Time.

3984
03:43:02,770 --> 03:43:04,170
We need three stones for that.

3985
03:43:04,830 --> 03:43:06,110
I guess the three triangles.

3986
03:43:09,990 --> 03:43:10,390
Triforce.

3987
03:43:12,330 --> 03:43:13,690
First we need a single force.

3988
03:43:15,210 --> 03:43:16,390
And then a dual force.

3989
03:43:24,580 --> 03:43:25,160
This way.

3990
03:43:30,390 --> 03:43:32,230
Now, let's go see if we can't find Zelda.

3991
03:43:34,770 --> 03:43:35,450
Oh, wait a minute.

3992
03:43:35,510 --> 03:43:36,270
Is that an Aero Shop?

3993
03:43:39,380 --> 03:43:40,140
Uh, get in.

3994
03:43:42,600 --> 03:43:43,900
Maybe you sell a bow to me?

3995
03:43:44,620 --> 03:43:45,300
What's up, Gorok?

3996
03:43:46,820 --> 03:43:48,240
Do you want to play a game?

3997
03:43:48,520 --> 03:43:50,180
It's 20 rupees per play.

3998
03:43:51,480 --> 03:43:51,960
Uh...

3999
03:43:51,960 --> 03:43:52,580
Maybe?

4000
03:43:52,760 --> 03:43:53,180
Do I win?

4001
03:43:53,520 --> 03:43:54,720
Rupees back or something?

4002
03:43:55,620 --> 03:43:56,520
Nice chest here.

4003
03:43:57,660 --> 03:43:58,220
Okay!

4004
03:43:58,660 --> 03:44:00,160
This is a game for grown-ups.

4005
03:44:00,860 --> 03:44:02,320
Hyrule's famous shooting gallery.

4006
03:44:03,800 --> 03:44:06,440
Take aim at the targets from that platform over there.

4007
03:44:07,040 --> 03:44:08,380
Can you hit 10 targets?

4008
03:44:08,720 --> 03:44:10,280
You get 15 shots.

4009
03:44:11,380 --> 03:44:12,860
Draw your weapon with B.

4010
03:44:13,260 --> 03:44:13,860
Are you ready?

4011
03:44:14,700 --> 03:44:15,960
Go for a perfect score.

4012
03:44:16,160 --> 03:44:16,480
Good luck!

4013
03:44:17,560 --> 03:44:18,520
Oh, shh...

4014
03:44:18,520 --> 03:44:19,140
Uh...

4015
03:44:19,140 --> 03:44:19,900
Be, uh...

4016
03:44:19,900 --> 03:44:20,140
This one.

4017
03:44:23,150 --> 03:44:23,630
What?

4018
03:44:23,750 --> 03:44:24,290
How do I shoot?

4019
03:44:26,210 --> 03:44:26,690
What?

4020
03:44:26,750 --> 03:44:28,050
Why do they change keybinds on me suddenly?

4021
03:44:38,140 --> 03:44:38,620
What?

4022
03:44:39,640 --> 03:44:40,580
Oh, they're down there?

4023
03:44:45,080 --> 03:44:45,560
Uh...

4024
03:44:47,500 --> 03:44:48,880
It's so incredibly sensitive.

4025
03:44:56,530 --> 03:44:57,030
Yeah!

4026
03:44:57,750 --> 03:44:58,470
Too bad!

4027
03:44:59,850 --> 03:45:01,310
Practice hard and come back!

4028
03:45:03,390 --> 03:45:04,470
Want to play a game?

4029
03:45:05,870 --> 03:45:06,370
No!

4030
03:45:06,570 --> 03:45:08,070
No, no, hold on, hold on, hold on.

4031
03:45:11,720 --> 03:45:13,800
Why do they change the keybinds on me suddenly?

4032
03:45:14,320 --> 03:45:17,040
Like, up until this point, the keybind for...

4033
03:45:17,040 --> 03:45:18,740
You know, drawing the bow was different!

4034
03:45:19,320 --> 03:45:20,480
That's fucking confusing!

4035
03:45:21,900 --> 03:45:23,180
It's completely different now.

4036
03:45:24,800 --> 03:45:27,040
The game has been preparing me for the wrong thing!

4037
03:45:27,840 --> 03:45:28,800
Yes, let's go again.

4038
03:45:29,560 --> 03:45:30,480
I'm spending all my money!

4039
03:45:32,240 --> 03:45:33,200
Oh, God!

4040
03:45:35,940 --> 03:45:36,860
Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah!

4041
03:45:37,160 --> 03:45:37,900
Get to it!

4042
03:45:39,940 --> 03:45:40,560
Oh, shit!

4043
03:45:44,080 --> 03:45:44,560
Uh...

4044
03:45:45,080 --> 03:45:45,560
Nice!

4045
03:45:49,640 --> 03:45:50,320
Oh, my God!

4046
03:45:51,680 --> 03:45:52,160
Ah!

4047
03:45:55,060 --> 03:45:56,040
It's so sensitive!

4048
03:45:58,360 --> 03:45:58,980
What?

4049
03:46:05,750 --> 03:46:10,370
You don't understand how inaccurate this fucking controller is.

4050
03:46:12,420 --> 03:46:14,950
I'm moving in a nanometer, and it's flying across the screen.

4051
03:46:15,670 --> 03:46:16,670
Ah, it's impossible.

4052
03:46:18,130 --> 03:46:19,230
Unbelievably impossible.

4053
03:46:20,010 --> 03:46:23,030
And with this input lag, it's just not possible!

4054
03:46:23,750 --> 03:46:25,070
I lost all my money.

4055
03:46:27,760 --> 03:46:28,720
Oh, God!

4056
03:46:31,740 --> 03:46:34,900
You don't understand, guys, how hard that was.

4057
03:46:36,020 --> 03:46:36,960
Uh, there are 10 targets.

4058
03:46:37,060 --> 03:46:37,940
You have 15 chances.

4059
03:46:38,080 --> 03:46:38,940
Hit all 10 targets.

4060
03:46:39,860 --> 03:46:40,820
Hit 10 targets.

4061
03:46:40,940 --> 03:46:41,620
Perfect prize.

4062
03:46:42,540 --> 03:46:44,100
Hit 8 on more free retry.

4063
03:46:45,660 --> 03:46:46,020
Oh!

4064
03:46:49,110 --> 03:46:50,250
Rules of the shooting gallery.

4065
03:46:50,450 --> 03:46:51,250
Don't lean on the counter.

4066
03:46:51,410 --> 03:46:52,390
Don't disturb other customers.

4067
03:46:53,910 --> 03:46:54,470
Oh, my God.

4068
03:46:54,510 --> 03:46:55,150
I should have read the rules.

4069
03:46:56,810 --> 03:46:58,210
I mean, we're broke anyway, right?

4070
03:46:58,410 --> 03:46:59,130
Let's just go again.

4071
03:47:01,970 --> 03:47:02,850
Yeah, I go again.

4072
03:47:04,910 --> 03:47:05,270
Trust!

4073
03:47:09,060 --> 03:47:09,420
Done!

4074
03:47:12,570 --> 03:47:13,290
Nice!

4075
03:47:15,090 --> 03:47:15,810
Shit.

4076
03:47:17,070 --> 03:47:17,630
No!

4077
03:47:18,330 --> 03:47:18,810
No!

4078
03:47:19,150 --> 03:47:19,450
No!

4079
03:47:33,490 --> 03:47:34,470
It's over!

4080
03:47:35,110 --> 03:47:36,110
It's over!

4081
03:47:40,470 --> 03:47:41,570
It's impossible!

4082
03:47:43,350 --> 03:47:44,070
What?

4083
03:47:47,600 --> 03:47:50,000
I lost all of my money.

4084
03:47:51,500 --> 03:47:53,180
Oh, my God.

4085
03:47:53,400 --> 03:47:54,980
Can I pick up the money on the floor at least?

4086
03:47:57,600 --> 03:47:58,140
Oh, wait.

4087
03:47:58,220 --> 03:47:59,300
I can't lean on the counter, right?

4088
03:47:59,520 --> 03:47:59,860
Fuck!

4089
03:48:00,900 --> 03:48:01,520
All right.

4090
03:48:02,120 --> 03:48:03,280
I'll see you later, dude.

4091
03:48:05,800 --> 03:48:07,000
Oh, crap.

4092
03:48:10,150 --> 03:48:12,090
Uh, let's try going in here.

4093
03:48:14,690 --> 03:48:15,690
What's this place?

4094
03:48:16,770 --> 03:48:17,190
What?

4095
03:48:18,270 --> 03:48:20,090
Bom-choo Bowling Alley.

4096
03:48:23,440 --> 03:48:24,040
Sleeping.

4097
03:48:27,150 --> 03:48:28,930
Oh, I'm sorry.

4098
03:48:29,510 --> 03:48:31,210
We're not open for business yet.

4099
03:48:31,210 --> 03:48:32,710
Please come back soon.

4100
03:48:34,030 --> 03:48:35,450
I think you're lying to me.

4101
03:48:39,600 --> 03:48:40,500
Huh, okay.

4102
03:48:43,060 --> 03:48:44,420
I'll come back later, then.

4103
03:48:46,700 --> 03:48:48,620
I thought this was a disco for a second.

4104
03:48:49,300 --> 03:48:50,160
Let's go upstairs.

4105
03:48:59,250 --> 03:48:59,770
What?

4106
03:48:59,930 --> 03:49:00,630
Am I...

4107
03:49:00,630 --> 03:49:02,190
Oh, I'm finding money.

4108
03:49:05,600 --> 03:49:06,460
What's going on?

4109
03:49:07,200 --> 03:49:11,320
They say we Hylian's have big ears in order to hear the voices of the gods.

4110
03:49:11,800 --> 03:49:13,100
But I've never heard them.

4111
03:49:15,160 --> 03:49:16,620
Well, that's obvious.

4112
03:49:16,720 --> 03:49:17,820
You're not using your ears.

4113
03:49:18,060 --> 03:49:19,640
You're using your eyes right now.

4114
03:49:20,800 --> 03:49:21,360
Dumbass.

4115
03:49:23,990 --> 03:49:24,910
Oh, my God.

4116
03:49:25,030 --> 03:49:25,730
This is so advanced.

4117
03:49:26,990 --> 03:49:27,850
Who lives here?

4118
03:49:28,750 --> 03:49:29,010
Oh.

4119
03:49:30,090 --> 03:49:31,230
Treasure chest contest.

4120
03:49:31,510 --> 03:49:32,250
Temporarily closed.

4121
03:49:32,930 --> 03:49:33,470
Open tonight!

4122
03:49:33,470 --> 03:49:35,250
Oh, shit.

4123
03:49:35,730 --> 03:49:36,910
I want to participate.

4124
03:49:40,130 --> 03:49:40,830
Back alley.

4125
03:49:42,830 --> 03:49:43,810
Hey, Sonny!

4126
03:49:43,950 --> 03:49:45,610
I'll tell you something helpful.

4127
03:49:47,130 --> 03:49:51,130
I heard there is a mysterious fountain somewhere near the castle.

4128
03:49:53,730 --> 03:49:54,330
Oh, yeah?

4129
03:49:54,950 --> 03:49:56,670
Why should I trust you, old man?

4130
03:49:59,640 --> 03:50:01,640
What are you hiding underneath that blanket of yours?

4131
03:50:02,360 --> 03:50:03,240
Open your blanket!

4132
03:50:18,490 --> 03:50:21,270
I still can't believe I wasted all my money at that place.

4133
03:50:21,950 --> 03:50:22,910
What a disaster.

4134
03:50:24,530 --> 03:50:25,430
There's nothing in here.

4135
03:50:31,490 --> 03:50:33,610
Dude, this game actually looks sick.

4136
03:50:34,730 --> 03:50:36,990
When you think about the fact that it's from...

4137
03:50:36,990 --> 03:50:40,850
Well, I don't even know when, but Nintendo 64 is fucking forever ago.

4138
03:50:45,400 --> 03:50:45,960
Okay.

4139
03:50:46,980 --> 03:50:48,340
That was very uneventful.

4140
03:50:49,000 --> 03:50:49,560
Strange.

4141
03:50:49,960 --> 03:50:51,220
This door doesn't open.

4142
03:50:52,600 --> 03:50:53,620
That is strange.

4143
03:50:53,960 --> 03:50:54,580
Is it, though?

4144
03:50:54,760 --> 03:50:56,040
I mean, doors are locked sometimes.

4145
03:50:56,040 --> 03:50:58,640
It's one of the reasons you have doors.

4146
03:51:00,080 --> 03:51:00,880
You there!

4147
03:51:02,340 --> 03:51:02,900
Sir!

4148
03:51:05,120 --> 03:51:08,740
It seems strange that packs of dogs roam our streets at night.

4149
03:51:09,640 --> 03:51:11,180
Doesn't that seem weird to you?

4150
03:51:13,480 --> 03:51:13,960
Maybe.

4151
03:51:14,240 --> 03:51:15,000
I mean...

4152
03:51:15,000 --> 03:51:16,840
I don't know how you do things here.

4153
03:51:16,960 --> 03:51:17,780
Maybe it's not so weird.

4154
03:51:20,660 --> 03:51:21,900
Can I open the map or something?

4155
03:51:25,010 --> 03:51:25,490
Oh.

4156
03:51:27,750 --> 03:51:28,870
Let me put away the shield.

4157
03:51:31,690 --> 03:51:32,170
Okay.

4158
03:51:33,050 --> 03:51:33,850
What's this way?

4159
03:51:35,730 --> 03:51:36,790
This guy looks suspicious.

4160
03:51:36,970 --> 03:51:37,890
He's about to ambush me.

4161
03:51:39,530 --> 03:51:39,970
Sir!

4162
03:51:42,310 --> 03:51:42,750
Hey!

4163
03:51:43,190 --> 03:51:43,490
What?

4164
03:51:43,970 --> 03:51:46,250
What's wrong with loitering around all day?

4165
03:51:47,250 --> 03:51:47,850
Huh, kid?

4166
03:51:48,950 --> 03:51:49,710
Nothing, nothing.

4167
03:51:49,830 --> 03:51:50,210
I'm sorry.

4168
03:51:50,910 --> 03:51:52,210
I didn't mean nothing by it.

4169
03:51:52,690 --> 03:51:57,090
Just the way you were standing there behind the wall made me think you were going to ambush me.

4170
03:51:59,850 --> 03:52:01,270
The door's also closed.

4171
03:52:05,500 --> 03:52:06,600
Nice city you got here.

4172
03:52:09,560 --> 03:52:11,340
Okay, I think I see the castle in the distance.

4173
03:52:12,560 --> 03:52:13,320
Let's go this way.

4174
03:52:18,460 --> 03:52:19,060
Oh, yeah.

4175
03:52:20,240 --> 03:52:20,920
Hyrule Castle!

4176
03:52:23,620 --> 03:52:24,920
Look at the town down there.

4177
03:52:24,980 --> 03:52:25,920
That's actually so nice.

4178
03:52:28,220 --> 03:52:28,620
Oh.

4179
03:52:29,420 --> 03:52:30,120
Hey, Link!

4180
03:52:30,680 --> 03:52:31,260
This way!

4181
03:52:31,260 --> 03:52:34,840
Jesus Christ, don't startle me like that!

4182
03:52:35,320 --> 03:52:37,300
The princess is inside the castle just ahead.

4183
03:52:37,580 --> 03:52:39,360
Be careful not to get caught by the guards.

4184
03:52:39,800 --> 03:52:40,080
Oh!

4185
03:52:42,080 --> 03:52:44,220
On this ground, time flows normally.

4186
03:52:46,380 --> 03:52:51,000
But time stands still while you are in Lon Lon Ranch or in a town.

4187
03:52:52,440 --> 03:52:52,960
Aha!

4188
03:52:53,400 --> 03:52:56,640
If you want time to pass normally, you'll need to leave town.

4189
03:52:58,100 --> 03:52:58,920
Well, well.

4190
03:52:59,260 --> 03:53:00,840
Which way are you going to go now?

4191
03:53:01,500 --> 03:53:02,100
Ho, ho, ho!

4192
03:53:04,080 --> 03:53:05,480
You want to hear what I said again?

4193
03:53:07,040 --> 03:53:08,060
Now I see what's happening.

4194
03:53:08,160 --> 03:53:09,600
He turns his head upside down.

4195
03:53:09,800 --> 03:53:10,740
I was so confused.

4196
03:53:11,900 --> 03:53:13,620
Uh, no, I don't want to hear what you said again.

4197
03:53:13,840 --> 03:53:14,420
I got it.

4198
03:53:15,520 --> 03:53:16,000
Ho, ho!

4199
03:53:16,260 --> 03:53:17,040
You're a smart kid.

4200
03:53:17,560 --> 03:53:18,240
Good luck then.

4201
03:53:18,640 --> 03:53:18,980
Hoo, hoo!

4202
03:53:19,760 --> 03:53:20,500
I'll see you later.

4203
03:53:23,080 --> 03:53:25,160
And he flies off so majestically once again.

4204
03:53:26,800 --> 03:53:28,040
Also, how does he know my name?

4205
03:53:29,140 --> 03:53:30,420
Am I a known quantity?

4206
03:53:31,200 --> 03:53:32,220
Do people know me?

4207
03:53:32,780 --> 03:53:32,960
Oops.

4208
03:53:36,470 --> 03:53:37,130
What's that?

4209
03:53:37,990 --> 03:53:38,390
Whoops.

4210
03:53:42,640 --> 03:53:43,880
Oh, I need money though.

4211
03:53:44,280 --> 03:53:45,100
I don't need this crap.

4212
03:53:50,040 --> 03:53:50,480
Spiders.

4213
03:53:56,080 --> 03:53:57,300
Oh, we got a guard here.

4214
03:53:59,020 --> 03:53:59,940
Probably no access.

4215
03:54:02,620 --> 03:54:05,480
So, you say you want to see Princess Zelda, eh?

4216
03:54:06,880 --> 03:54:09,580
You probably heard about her in town.

4217
03:54:09,880 --> 03:54:11,800
And decided you had to meet her.

4218
03:54:12,320 --> 03:54:14,240
Well, go home.

4219
03:54:14,620 --> 03:54:15,500
Get out of here.

4220
03:54:15,900 --> 03:54:18,540
The princess would never grant an audience to the likes of you.

4221
03:54:19,640 --> 03:54:20,120
Wow.

4222
03:54:20,860 --> 03:54:21,580
That's rude.

4223
03:54:21,780 --> 03:54:24,120
Don't you know that we kind of know each other?

4224
03:54:24,700 --> 03:54:25,520
Actually, do we?

4225
03:54:25,660 --> 03:54:26,540
Maybe we don't at this point.

4226
03:54:27,880 --> 03:54:29,880
I actually don't know when this place...

4227
03:54:29,880 --> 03:54:31,820
Or when this game takes place.

4228
03:54:32,680 --> 03:54:34,180
In the timeline of things.

4229
03:54:36,700 --> 03:54:37,900
Wait, do we...

4230
03:54:37,900 --> 03:54:39,480
Maybe we don't know Zelda yet.

4231
03:54:41,040 --> 03:54:41,900
Holy shit.

4232
03:54:46,300 --> 03:54:46,800
Then again.

4233
03:54:47,460 --> 03:54:51,120
Breath of the Wild didn't really provide much in terms of lore either.

4234
03:54:51,520 --> 03:54:54,800
Except, hey, you woke up after 100 years and now everything is fucked.

4235
03:54:55,300 --> 03:54:57,520
We need you to save everything and save Zelda.

4236
03:54:59,340 --> 03:55:00,040
So, you know.

4237
03:55:00,780 --> 03:55:01,380
A little bit.

4238
03:55:01,500 --> 03:55:02,160
Also, it's been a while.

4239
03:55:02,240 --> 03:55:03,440
Maybe you don't remember things clearly.

4240
03:55:04,620 --> 03:55:06,280
Let's check out this door over here.

4241
03:55:06,360 --> 03:55:06,960
There seems to be a door.

4242
03:55:09,680 --> 03:55:10,000
Huh?

4243
03:55:10,440 --> 03:55:10,760
What?

4244
03:55:11,200 --> 03:55:11,600
Shoo, kid.

4245
03:55:11,700 --> 03:55:11,940
Shoo!

4246
03:55:12,880 --> 03:55:13,420
Oh, sorry.

4247
03:55:13,580 --> 03:55:13,780
Sorry.

4248
03:55:15,380 --> 03:55:16,780
I guess that was the cellar.

4249
03:55:17,140 --> 03:55:18,460
So this guy is suspicious as hell.

4250
03:55:21,960 --> 03:55:25,360
Uh, have you heard that Princess Zelda sees prophetic visions in her dreams?

4251
03:55:26,820 --> 03:55:29,080
I have not heard that, actually.

4252
03:55:31,460 --> 03:55:32,160
Hey, let go.

4253
03:55:32,160 --> 03:55:32,540
It's mine.

4254
03:55:32,760 --> 03:55:33,560
I found it first.

4255
03:55:34,700 --> 03:55:37,820
Wow, you guys are just so willing to offer up your money, huh?

4256
03:55:38,240 --> 03:55:39,140
Oh, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait.

4257
03:55:39,220 --> 03:55:39,520
Who are you?

4258
03:55:42,080 --> 03:55:44,560
Have you heard the legend of the Shadow Folk?

4259
03:55:46,080 --> 03:55:50,420
They are the Sheikah, the shadows of the Hylians, or Hylians.

4260
03:55:51,720 --> 03:55:56,500
They say they swore allegiance to the King of Hyrule and guarded the royal family.

4261
03:55:57,760 --> 03:55:59,860
I think I have heard of them, the Sheikah tribe.

4262
03:56:00,280 --> 03:56:04,000
But with the Long Peace, no one has seen a Sheikah around here for a long time.

4263
03:56:05,600 --> 03:56:06,720
The Long Peace.

4264
03:56:08,340 --> 03:56:14,200
However, I heard there was one Sheikah woman living in the castle.

4265
03:56:15,660 --> 03:56:16,220
Really?

4266
03:56:17,320 --> 03:56:19,160
Look at this old hag.

4267
03:56:21,320 --> 03:56:23,060
I made a lot of money.

4268
03:56:24,400 --> 03:56:27,280
Maybe I should go look for more things to sell.

4269
03:56:28,320 --> 03:56:29,140
I know!

4270
03:56:29,800 --> 03:56:31,740
I should go to Lake Hyliya.

4271
03:56:32,380 --> 03:56:34,940
Many things float down the river and end up there.

4272
03:56:35,220 --> 03:56:35,640
Ha ha ha!

4273
03:56:37,360 --> 03:56:38,300
Get lost.

4274
03:56:39,760 --> 03:56:40,420
Ma'am?

4275
03:56:42,400 --> 03:56:44,900
I might have seen a cute little girl around here.

4276
03:56:45,220 --> 03:56:47,000
Maybe she went to the castle?

4277
03:56:47,540 --> 03:56:48,200
Who knows?

4278
03:56:49,600 --> 03:56:51,080
What are you doing with your hands?

4279
03:56:52,260 --> 03:56:53,100
What is that?

4280
03:56:55,920 --> 03:56:56,800
What's happening?

4281
03:56:58,040 --> 03:56:58,360
Sir?

4282
03:57:00,680 --> 03:57:01,560
Hey, forest boy!

4283
03:57:02,140 --> 03:57:03,160
This is the city of Hyrule.

4284
03:57:03,440 --> 03:57:05,000
Take your time and enjoy this ice.

4285
03:57:06,620 --> 03:57:10,400
If you came here to see Hyrule Castle, take the street on your right.

4286
03:57:11,360 --> 03:57:12,740
Nah, I already went there.

4287
03:57:13,420 --> 03:57:14,520
They wouldn't let me in.

4288
03:57:15,200 --> 03:57:18,580
If you want to see the back alleys of the town, take the street to the left.

4289
03:57:19,400 --> 03:57:20,000
Nah, I'm good.

4290
03:57:20,000 --> 03:57:20,720
I've been there.

4291
03:57:21,140 --> 03:57:22,240
Shady people, locked doors.

4292
03:57:22,460 --> 03:57:22,860
Not for me.

4293
03:57:24,880 --> 03:57:25,980
What about this dog?

4294
03:57:27,920 --> 03:57:29,740
Can I somehow feed you?

4295
03:57:31,840 --> 03:57:32,480
Shave you?

4296
03:57:33,040 --> 03:57:33,840
With my sword?

4297
03:57:34,720 --> 03:57:35,800
Uh, little girl!

4298
03:57:38,020 --> 03:57:38,820
No, no, no.

4299
03:57:39,000 --> 03:57:39,400
Not you.

4300
03:57:39,620 --> 03:57:40,960
I'm not dancing, you know?

4301
03:57:41,200 --> 03:57:42,240
My back itches.

4302
03:57:42,440 --> 03:57:42,540
Ooh!

4303
03:57:42,860 --> 03:57:43,000
Ah!

4304
03:57:43,280 --> 03:57:43,580
Ooh!

4305
03:57:44,920 --> 03:57:46,200
So what are you doing then?

4306
03:57:46,440 --> 03:57:47,680
Because that's what I thought you were doing.

4307
03:57:49,500 --> 03:57:49,860
Girl!

4308
03:57:50,760 --> 03:57:51,440
Speak to me!

4309
03:57:53,600 --> 03:57:54,760
I can't speak with her anymore.

4310
03:57:59,380 --> 03:58:01,620
So there's an interaction prompt on it, but...

4311
03:58:03,900 --> 03:58:04,260
Oh!

4312
03:58:05,300 --> 03:58:06,240
I can't catch that.

4313
03:58:06,340 --> 03:58:06,580
Coco!

4314
03:58:07,200 --> 03:58:08,100
I know, I know.

4315
03:58:08,200 --> 03:58:08,820
I'm trying to help you.

4316
03:58:09,700 --> 03:58:10,540
Oh, that's a dog.

4317
03:58:12,380 --> 03:58:14,160
Yeah, you can't interact with it for some reason.

4318
03:58:15,840 --> 03:58:17,900
Alright, let's go to, uh, the ranch.

4319
03:58:18,680 --> 03:58:19,440
Check that out.

4320
03:58:21,420 --> 03:58:22,500
This is a cool place.

4321
03:58:22,660 --> 03:58:23,340
I like the castle.

4322
03:58:26,820 --> 03:58:28,740
Mystery guard, do you have anything else to say?

4323
03:58:31,120 --> 03:58:33,140
Uh, welcome to Hyrule Castle Town.

4324
03:58:33,740 --> 03:58:35,260
Okay, you said that before.

4325
03:58:35,960 --> 03:58:37,360
The big question is...

4326
03:58:38,340 --> 03:58:39,520
Are the pots back?

4327
03:58:40,220 --> 03:58:40,700
Oh!

4328
03:58:42,980 --> 03:58:44,440
Dude, this is actually just...

4329
03:58:46,360 --> 03:58:47,760
Why wouldn't I just do this?

4330
03:58:48,840 --> 03:58:50,220
Get enough money for the shield?

4331
03:58:54,200 --> 03:58:54,920
Like, hello?

4332
03:59:00,460 --> 03:59:01,780
I'm buying a shield today.

4333
03:59:03,780 --> 03:59:05,060
A shield that talks.

4334
03:59:05,800 --> 03:59:06,280
Harry!

4335
03:59:06,940 --> 03:59:08,280
Ha ha ha ha ha ha ha!

4336
03:59:10,640 --> 03:59:11,740
Got any Skittles?

4337
03:59:15,620 --> 03:59:17,020
Dude, I got so much money already.

4338
03:59:20,260 --> 03:59:22,020
Actual clever use of game mechanics.

4339
03:59:26,440 --> 03:59:27,680
All right, I think we got most of it.

4340
03:59:30,460 --> 03:59:31,500
I'll be right back, sir.

4341
03:59:37,420 --> 03:59:38,320
Oh ho ho ho!

4342
03:59:38,340 --> 03:59:38,700
Woo!

4343
03:59:38,900 --> 03:59:40,160
Here we go again, boy!

4344
03:59:40,820 --> 03:59:41,220
Yeah!

4345
03:59:42,240 --> 03:59:44,080
Dude, this is broken as hell!

4346
03:59:47,870 --> 03:59:48,670
Like, hello?

4347
03:59:52,020 --> 03:59:52,860
Ha ha ha ha!

4348
03:59:53,140 --> 03:59:54,840
Oh no, they disappeared after a time!

4349
03:59:55,420 --> 03:59:56,160
We gotta loot them quick!

4350
03:59:58,520 --> 03:59:59,120
Oh, shit.

4351
04:00:04,040 --> 04:00:04,720
We go again?

4352
04:00:13,540 --> 04:00:13,900
Okay.

4353
04:00:15,680 --> 04:00:16,360
Almost at 80!

4354
04:00:18,420 --> 04:00:19,840
All right, this is crazy.

4355
04:00:22,300 --> 04:00:22,960
Quick, quick, quick!

4356
04:00:30,120 --> 04:00:31,760
Maybe I gotta bribe, uh...

4357
04:00:32,580 --> 04:00:33,420
The guards, you know?

4358
04:00:33,540 --> 04:00:34,180
With enough money.

4359
04:00:35,980 --> 04:00:37,620
Or I play them the song of their people.

4360
04:00:39,080 --> 04:00:40,320
All right, let's go buy that shield.

4361
04:00:42,860 --> 04:00:44,340
This is infinite money.

4362
04:00:45,740 --> 04:00:47,440
Oh, I feel kind of bad.

4363
04:00:47,740 --> 04:00:49,640
I feel like that's not intended, but I don't know.

4364
04:00:52,760 --> 04:00:53,560
Shield was...

4365
04:00:53,560 --> 04:00:54,100
Was that in here?

4366
04:00:55,200 --> 04:00:56,040
I think it was in here.

4367
04:01:02,250 --> 04:01:02,650
Yeah!

4368
04:01:04,130 --> 04:01:05,130
I want this!

4369
04:01:06,650 --> 04:01:07,210
Buy it!

4370
04:01:11,940 --> 04:01:12,340
Nice.

4371
04:01:12,540 --> 04:01:14,200
Oh my god, it looks so cool, too.

4372
04:01:17,000 --> 04:01:18,020
Uh, I'm good.

4373
04:01:19,220 --> 04:01:19,940
Let's put it on.

4374
04:01:24,500 --> 04:01:24,860
Oh.

4375
04:01:28,160 --> 04:01:28,740
No, no.

4376
04:01:28,940 --> 04:01:29,320
Oh, yeah.

4377
04:01:29,460 --> 04:01:30,580
I guess we can save the game.

4378
04:01:30,720 --> 04:01:30,860
Oops.

4379
04:01:32,480 --> 04:01:37,360
I'm still not used to Nintendo having the accept button being the one on the right and not on the bottom, you know?

4380
04:01:38,340 --> 04:01:39,020
It's weird.

4381
04:01:41,540 --> 04:01:43,260
Oh, would you look at that!

4382
04:01:43,740 --> 04:01:45,560
Holy shit, we're a proper knight now.

4383
04:01:46,840 --> 04:01:49,180
Except, uh, we're running around in racks.

4384
04:01:49,640 --> 04:01:50,940
How about some proper armor?

4385
04:01:52,960 --> 04:01:53,440
Um.

4386
04:01:55,760 --> 04:01:57,320
Wait, wasn't I go see...

4387
04:01:57,320 --> 04:01:58,660
Wasn't I supposed to go see Zelda?

4388
04:01:58,720 --> 04:01:59,200
I'm confused.

4389
04:02:00,400 --> 04:02:02,200
Maybe there's something about the back alleys.

4390
04:02:03,960 --> 04:02:05,300
Let's check that out one more time.

4391
04:02:07,560 --> 04:02:08,580
Now that I have this...

4392
04:02:08,580 --> 04:02:09,420
Are you gonna say anything else?

4393
04:02:10,820 --> 04:02:11,440
No, okay.

4394
04:02:13,800 --> 04:02:14,440
Maybe in here?

4395
04:02:17,440 --> 04:02:17,760
You.

4396
04:02:20,640 --> 04:02:21,700
No, okay, it's the same.

4397
04:02:23,940 --> 04:02:25,460
Yeah, it is strange that dogs come out.

4398
04:02:25,740 --> 04:02:27,640
But I guess I have to go out, and then, uh...

4399
04:02:28,400 --> 04:02:29,860
Oh, I know how to get into the castle.

4400
04:02:30,220 --> 04:02:30,740
Watch this.

4401
04:02:34,760 --> 04:02:35,680
We're gonna leave.

4402
04:02:35,980 --> 04:02:36,780
Wait till it's night.

4403
04:02:37,300 --> 04:02:39,420
And the guard will have fallen asleep or something.

4404
04:02:41,780 --> 04:02:43,260
Either that, or we spike his drink.

4405
04:02:48,960 --> 04:02:51,360
So apparently things will change when it's night, right?

4406
04:02:58,070 --> 04:02:59,130
Okay, while we're...

4407
04:02:59,130 --> 04:02:59,230
Oh!

4408
04:02:59,730 --> 04:03:01,570
Is that Lon Lon Ranch right there?

4409
04:03:02,590 --> 04:03:03,550
I think it is.

4410
04:03:05,350 --> 04:03:06,090
Speed mode!

4411
04:03:06,230 --> 04:03:06,390
Go!

4412
04:03:06,610 --> 04:03:06,870
Go!

4413
04:03:07,030 --> 04:03:07,250
Roll!

4414
04:03:10,370 --> 04:03:12,090
Can I actually run, somehow?

4415
04:03:13,190 --> 04:03:13,670
Wait, what?

4416
04:03:14,930 --> 04:03:16,150
Link, what are you doing?

4417
04:03:19,460 --> 04:03:20,000
Link!

4418
04:03:21,400 --> 04:03:22,360
What is this?

4419
04:03:24,120 --> 04:03:25,240
What was that?

4420
04:03:26,580 --> 04:03:28,060
Oh, we got a sign here.

4421
04:03:33,330 --> 04:03:35,470
Talon and Malon's Lon Lon Ranch.

4422
04:03:36,930 --> 04:03:37,470
Really?

4423
04:03:37,770 --> 04:03:38,470
Two people own it?

4424
04:03:39,050 --> 04:03:40,810
Oh my god, they have, uh...

4425
04:03:40,810 --> 04:03:41,950
Scaffolding permits here.

4426
04:03:42,990 --> 04:03:44,250
Would you look at that?

4427
04:03:46,590 --> 04:03:48,110
Dude, I'm loving the colors here.

4428
04:03:49,310 --> 04:03:50,550
Like, this looks good.

4429
04:03:51,090 --> 04:03:52,010
Look at this!

4430
04:03:52,590 --> 04:03:53,610
What a sick view.

4431
04:03:55,210 --> 04:03:55,510
Oh.

4432
04:03:58,910 --> 04:03:59,750
In we go.

4433
04:04:07,000 --> 04:04:08,180
We're gonna get a horse here.

4434
04:04:09,160 --> 04:04:09,900
I hope.

4435
04:04:17,340 --> 04:04:19,180
I just break all this shit.

4436
04:04:19,940 --> 04:04:20,820
Oh, man.

4437
04:04:25,640 --> 04:04:26,120
Stable.

4438
04:04:30,010 --> 04:04:30,950
That's not a horse.

4439
04:04:32,690 --> 04:04:33,530
That's a cow!

4440
04:04:35,950 --> 04:04:37,170
Why can't I speak with you?

4441
04:04:39,590 --> 04:04:40,070
What?

4442
04:04:41,330 --> 04:04:41,810
Okay.

4443
04:04:42,970 --> 04:04:43,810
Is that a door?

4444
04:04:45,590 --> 04:04:46,410
Not really.

4445
04:04:50,850 --> 04:04:51,850
A grow bed!

4446
04:04:55,430 --> 04:04:56,670
Wait a minute, what's the point here?

4447
04:05:01,870 --> 04:05:03,150
Wait a minute, what do you mean stable?

4448
04:05:03,150 --> 04:05:03,690
There's a...

4449
04:05:03,690 --> 04:05:05,210
There's a...

4450
04:05:05,210 --> 04:05:06,090
Cow!

4451
04:05:11,430 --> 04:05:12,550
That's what the cows do.

4452
04:05:12,630 --> 04:05:13,310
The cows go moo.

4453
04:05:15,470 --> 04:05:19,410
The GDT wanted us to go to visit the princess at Hyrule Castle.

4454
04:05:20,150 --> 04:05:21,230
Shouldn't we get going?

4455
04:05:22,450 --> 04:05:24,050
Navi, were you not with me?

4456
04:05:24,310 --> 04:05:25,530
The guy said no!

4457
04:05:27,450 --> 04:05:27,970
Navi!

4458
04:05:32,010 --> 04:05:33,210
What the hell's going on here?

4459
04:05:39,410 --> 04:05:40,750
Oh, it's the chicken coop.

4460
04:05:43,650 --> 04:05:44,530
I'm gonna go up here.

4461
04:05:48,030 --> 04:05:49,050
Just climb normally.

4462
04:05:51,090 --> 04:05:51,930
There's a door.

4463
04:05:53,750 --> 04:05:54,190
Open.

4464
04:05:56,330 --> 04:05:57,550
Look how tiny I am!

4465
04:05:57,670 --> 04:05:58,450
The door is massive.

4466
04:06:00,330 --> 04:06:01,590
What a fancy room.

4467
04:06:05,800 --> 04:06:07,160
Mind if I break some stuff, do you?

4468
04:06:10,250 --> 04:06:11,330
Can I open your drawers?

4469
04:06:16,380 --> 04:06:18,660
Okay, I must have missed something at the castle, I guess.

4470
04:06:23,490 --> 04:06:24,410
Let me go back there.

4471
04:06:36,520 --> 04:06:37,180
What was that?

4472
04:06:48,020 --> 04:06:48,720
Evil laugh.

4473
04:06:58,740 --> 04:06:59,460
Uh, no.

4474
04:07:07,360 --> 04:07:07,640
Oh!

4475
04:07:09,500 --> 04:07:10,860
There's an evil entity in there!

4476
04:07:13,780 --> 04:07:15,440
Okay, we gotta investigate that later.

4477
04:07:15,560 --> 04:07:17,120
Maybe we need to exorcise the demons.

4478
04:07:19,120 --> 04:07:20,200
Jesus Christ.

4479
04:07:21,640 --> 04:07:22,960
That is scary!

4480
04:07:28,740 --> 04:07:29,600
Oh, wait a minute.

4481
04:07:29,660 --> 04:07:30,440
Maybe it's just a chicken.

4482
04:07:32,220 --> 04:07:33,780
Is that the chicken sound?

4483
04:07:35,480 --> 04:07:36,020
Oh.

4484
04:07:39,460 --> 04:07:40,340
Make a sound.

4485
04:07:41,580 --> 04:07:42,820
What does the chicken say?

4486
04:07:46,460 --> 04:07:47,000
I...

4487
04:07:47,000 --> 04:07:47,600
I don't know.

4488
04:07:47,940 --> 04:07:49,420
I'm half between...

4489
04:07:49,420 --> 04:07:51,320
It's a chicken sound, and it's an evil entity.

4490
04:07:53,860 --> 04:07:55,800
And I feel like evil entity is more likely here.

4491
04:07:55,980 --> 04:07:56,820
Even though there are chickens.

4492
04:07:59,220 --> 04:08:01,180
Just the fact that I also heard it in that other room.

4493
04:08:02,300 --> 04:08:03,000
Can I go in that tunnel?

4494
04:08:03,360 --> 04:08:03,660
Oh, wait.

4495
04:08:03,720 --> 04:08:04,240
That's not a tunnel.

4496
04:08:05,060 --> 04:08:06,040
It looked like a tunnel.

4497
04:08:06,360 --> 04:08:07,520
I'm going back to the castle.

4498
04:08:07,620 --> 04:08:08,320
I want to check something.

4499
04:08:09,280 --> 04:08:10,520
Also, it's about to be night, right?

4500
04:08:11,100 --> 04:08:12,220
So let's wait for night.

4501
04:08:13,240 --> 04:08:14,000
And then we head in.

4502
04:08:15,920 --> 04:08:16,600
Oh, here we go.

4503
04:08:20,730 --> 04:08:21,490
Oh, they...

4504
04:08:21,490 --> 04:08:23,190
They closed it at night.

4505
04:08:23,810 --> 04:08:26,010
I thought they opened it because I approached.

4506
04:08:28,690 --> 04:08:29,910
Oh, okay.

4507
04:08:30,070 --> 04:08:31,450
Maybe there's a different way inside.

4508
04:08:32,750 --> 04:08:33,450
During the night.

4509
04:08:33,610 --> 04:08:34,530
Maybe I have to...

4510
04:08:34,530 --> 04:08:35,590
Climb the walls.

4511
04:08:35,770 --> 04:08:36,090
Oh, God.

4512
04:08:37,130 --> 04:08:37,790
Stay away from me.

4513
04:08:39,270 --> 04:08:41,750
There's three trees over here, which makes me think...

4514
04:08:41,750 --> 04:08:42,330
It's a puzzle.

4515
04:08:45,250 --> 04:08:46,770
One of the trees is not green.

4516
04:08:48,650 --> 04:08:50,170
Two of the trees have been seen.

4517
04:09:01,080 --> 04:09:02,320
Wait a sec.

4518
04:09:05,400 --> 04:09:06,820
Oh, you're evil.

4519
04:09:08,440 --> 04:09:09,420
Evil bastards.

4520
04:09:18,040 --> 04:09:19,520
I'm going to swim my way in.

4521
04:09:19,560 --> 04:09:20,960
Oh, there's bars.

4522
04:09:29,950 --> 04:09:31,230
Swimming against the current.

4523
04:09:32,750 --> 04:09:33,690
Oh, it's tough.

4524
04:09:34,390 --> 04:09:34,950
Come on, Link.

4525
04:09:38,020 --> 04:09:39,600
There's probably something in this moat.

4526
04:09:46,140 --> 04:09:47,020
I'm not sure.

4527
04:09:53,060 --> 04:09:53,880
Up we go.

4528
04:09:54,820 --> 04:09:56,060
Okay, it's about to be day again.

4529
04:09:57,040 --> 04:09:58,380
It means they're going to open the door.

4530
04:10:07,650 --> 04:10:08,050
Nice.

4531
04:10:18,970 --> 04:10:20,450
Man, this place is awesome.

4532
04:10:25,410 --> 04:10:28,110
But how am I going to get that melody from Asaria?

4533
04:10:29,770 --> 04:10:30,790
That's still on my mind.

4534
04:10:32,310 --> 04:10:34,470
It's bothering me a little bit that I didn't figure it out.

4535
04:10:38,130 --> 04:10:39,490
Okay, let's just try this again.

4536
04:10:41,870 --> 04:10:43,950
Maybe persistence is just what the doctor ordered, you know?

4537
04:10:44,070 --> 04:10:45,990
He's been like, oh, okay, you're back again the next day?

4538
04:10:46,130 --> 04:10:47,290
In that case, I'll let you pass.

4539
04:10:49,310 --> 04:10:50,390
Oh, look at this!

4540
04:10:52,190 --> 04:10:52,870
Hey!

4541
04:10:53,250 --> 04:10:53,590
Hey!

4542
04:10:53,590 --> 04:10:53,990
Your clothes!

4543
04:10:54,290 --> 04:10:55,450
They're different.

4544
04:10:56,050 --> 04:10:57,830
You're not from around here, are you?

4545
04:10:59,990 --> 04:11:01,430
I am not.

4546
04:11:02,530 --> 04:11:03,210
Oh!

4547
04:11:03,550 --> 04:11:05,750
You're a fairy boy from the forest!

4548
04:11:05,750 --> 04:11:08,470
My name is Malon, or Malon.

4549
04:11:08,830 --> 04:11:10,650
My dad owns Lon Lon Ranch.

4550
04:11:11,290 --> 04:11:12,310
Yeah, I was just over there!

4551
04:11:12,530 --> 04:11:14,310
You got evil entities up in that bitch!

4552
04:11:15,810 --> 04:11:18,090
Dad went to the castle to deliver some milk.

4553
04:11:18,490 --> 04:11:19,950
And he hasn't come back yet!

4554
04:11:21,070 --> 04:11:21,470
Aw!

4555
04:11:23,130 --> 04:11:24,170
I'm sorry to hear that.

4556
04:11:24,930 --> 04:11:27,030
He went to the castle to deliver some milk, eh?

4557
04:11:34,830 --> 04:11:35,930
Is that the owl?

4558
04:11:39,590 --> 04:11:41,090
I don't know what that animal is!

4559
04:11:48,080 --> 04:11:49,740
So you say you want to see the princess?

4560
04:11:50,840 --> 04:11:51,580
Yes, please!

4561
04:11:53,000 --> 04:11:54,560
Okay, you're not gonna let me in, are you?

4562
04:11:56,000 --> 04:11:56,400
Huh.

4563
04:11:57,660 --> 04:11:59,020
What if I were to...

4564
04:11:59,460 --> 04:12:00,800
distract you a little bit?

4565
04:12:03,800 --> 04:12:04,400
Look over there!

4566
04:12:07,000 --> 04:12:08,520
Wait, how would I get in, anyway?

4567
04:12:11,620 --> 04:12:12,760
Maybe there's an alternate path.

4568
04:12:14,000 --> 04:12:15,000
Can I climb this tree?

4569
04:12:19,440 --> 04:12:20,860
Whoops, I didn't mean to do that.

4570
04:12:23,740 --> 04:12:24,400
Oh, wait a minute.

4571
04:12:26,480 --> 04:12:26,800
Oh!

4572
04:12:27,240 --> 04:12:28,020
Okay, here we go!

4573
04:12:29,440 --> 04:12:30,040
Oh, no, no.

4574
04:12:30,920 --> 04:12:31,540
Link, climb.

4575
04:12:32,120 --> 04:12:33,020
Link, Link, what are you doing?

4576
04:12:33,200 --> 04:12:33,400
Come on.

4577
04:12:37,770 --> 04:12:38,090
Oh.

4578
04:12:38,950 --> 04:12:39,270
Link!

4579
04:12:39,270 --> 04:12:39,350
Link!

4580
04:12:42,110 --> 04:12:43,350
Climb the beanstalk!

4581
04:12:45,670 --> 04:12:47,270
Oh, here we go.

4582
04:12:49,250 --> 04:12:51,010
This is so weird.

4583
04:12:51,170 --> 04:12:52,050
These things...

4584
04:12:52,990 --> 04:12:54,110
I don't understand.

4585
04:12:57,380 --> 04:12:58,300
What's the time?

4586
04:13:01,240 --> 04:13:01,880
1310.

4587
04:13:02,720 --> 04:13:03,360
Oh,

4588
04:13:07,410 --> 04:13:08,210
wait a minute.

4589
04:13:08,410 --> 04:13:08,930
I think I...

4590
04:13:08,930 --> 04:13:10,310
Okay, I understand what's happening.

4591
04:13:11,270 --> 04:13:13,770
It's literally just telling me the time in the game.

4592
04:13:14,790 --> 04:13:17,550
And the reason it was 12 and 12 again and again...

4593
04:13:17,550 --> 04:13:20,710
Is because I was in the Kokiri Forest...

4594
04:13:20,710 --> 04:13:21,950
Where time doesn't flow.

4595
04:13:22,530 --> 04:13:23,030
Right?

4596
04:13:23,510 --> 04:13:25,310
That's why it was constantly the same.

4597
04:13:26,710 --> 04:13:27,690
I get it now.

4598
04:13:29,250 --> 04:13:29,750
Cool.

4599
04:13:32,070 --> 04:13:32,770
Oh, God.

4600
04:13:32,910 --> 04:13:34,150
This guy's gonna see me, though, isn't he?

4601
04:13:36,170 --> 04:13:37,170
Maybe I climb down here.

4602
04:13:37,290 --> 04:13:38,590
They're not gonna be heavy about me...

4603
04:13:39,870 --> 04:13:40,750
Entering the castle.

4604
04:13:49,870 --> 04:13:50,750
Yeah, let's go this way.

4605
04:13:53,390 --> 04:13:53,750
Ha!

4606
04:13:53,850 --> 04:13:54,930
Is he not gonna see me?

4607
04:13:56,990 --> 04:13:57,810
Hey, what's up, dude?

4608
04:13:59,830 --> 04:14:01,030
Let me just taunt him a little bit.

4609
04:14:16,970 --> 04:14:18,550
He does not register anything.

4610
04:14:19,950 --> 04:14:20,670
That dude...

4611
04:14:20,670 --> 04:14:21,570
Has no hearing.

4612
04:14:25,720 --> 04:14:26,220
Dead end.

4613
04:14:29,670 --> 04:14:30,510
I don't believe you.

4614
04:14:34,620 --> 04:14:35,700
That is not a dead end.

4615
04:14:35,820 --> 04:14:37,120
We're gonna be able to destroy this rock...

4616
04:14:37,120 --> 04:14:38,600
And there's gonna be a little hole we can crawl into.

4617
04:14:39,020 --> 04:14:40,780
And there's gonna be a chest on the other side...

4618
04:14:41,520 --> 04:14:41,840
Containing...

4619
04:14:42,680 --> 04:14:43,000
Uh...

4620
04:14:43,800 --> 04:14:44,300
Wait a minute.

4621
04:14:44,420 --> 04:14:44,840
Time flows.

4622
04:14:49,650 --> 04:14:49,970
Also...

4623
04:14:50,790 --> 04:14:52,150
Are you guys gonna go amok now?

4624
04:14:53,530 --> 04:14:54,050
Hey, you!

4625
04:14:54,250 --> 04:14:54,470
Stop!

4626
04:14:55,050 --> 04:14:55,570
You, kid!

4627
04:14:55,710 --> 04:14:56,010
Over there!

4628
04:14:57,610 --> 04:14:58,110
Uh-oh.

4629
04:14:59,730 --> 04:15:00,330
Oh!

4630
04:15:01,030 --> 04:15:01,510
Fuck!

4631
04:15:01,710 --> 04:15:02,230
Okay, yeah.

4632
04:15:03,490 --> 04:15:04,090
Shit.

4633
04:15:04,870 --> 04:15:06,010
Wait, what's that sound?

4634
04:15:17,810 --> 04:15:19,370
Is that Zelda singing?

4635
04:15:23,490 --> 04:15:24,470
Or is it you?

4636
04:15:28,380 --> 04:15:29,400
It is you!

4637
04:15:30,400 --> 04:15:32,100
Are you going to the castle, fairy boy?

4638
04:15:32,540 --> 04:15:34,020
Would you mind finding my dad?

4639
04:15:35,060 --> 04:15:38,140
He must have fallen asleep somewhere around the castle.

4640
04:15:38,600 --> 04:15:40,660
What a thing for an adult to do.

4641
04:15:41,500 --> 04:15:41,840
Teehee!

4642
04:15:43,300 --> 04:15:43,940
Oh, yeah.

4643
04:15:44,340 --> 04:15:46,340
If you look for him, I'll give this to you.

4644
04:15:47,580 --> 04:15:50,160
I've been incubating this egg very carefully.

4645
04:15:50,860 --> 04:15:51,360
What?

4646
04:15:54,760 --> 04:15:56,080
You got a weird egg!

4647
04:15:56,740 --> 04:15:58,500
Feels like there's something moving inside.

4648
04:15:59,460 --> 04:16:00,840
Set it to C and see what happens.

4649
04:16:01,520 --> 04:16:02,380
Oh, I get it.

4650
04:16:02,800 --> 04:16:04,340
See what happens?

4651
04:16:04,640 --> 04:16:05,120
Nice.

4652
04:16:09,120 --> 04:16:12,560
Okay, well, let's do that.

4653
04:16:15,420 --> 04:16:18,560
Oh, the map is also revealing more things as you explore.

4654
04:16:18,740 --> 04:16:18,880
Look!

4655
04:16:19,300 --> 04:16:20,400
That's really neat.

4656
04:16:26,220 --> 04:16:27,700
Also, what was this?

4657
04:16:32,170 --> 04:16:33,050
Cucurus Emerald.

4658
04:16:33,770 --> 04:16:34,850
Oh, yeah, right, right, right.

4659
04:16:34,950 --> 04:16:35,330
Okay, okay.

4660
04:16:36,310 --> 04:16:38,170
But how do I do the thing?

4661
04:16:38,910 --> 04:16:39,550
Oh, here!

4662
04:16:39,710 --> 04:16:40,070
Weird egg.

4663
04:16:47,580 --> 04:16:49,820
It looks like this item doesn't work here.

4664
04:16:52,700 --> 04:16:53,140
Really?

4665
04:16:58,670 --> 04:16:59,110
Okay.

4666
04:17:01,230 --> 04:17:03,170
Let me try and climb in during the night.

4667
04:17:05,410 --> 04:17:06,350
I'll be right back.

4668
04:17:07,970 --> 04:17:08,430
Uh...

4669
04:17:08,430 --> 04:17:09,810
No, no, no, no, no, don't, don't do that.

4670
04:17:09,930 --> 04:17:10,230
Don't...

4671
04:17:10,230 --> 04:17:10,450
Stop.

4672
04:17:12,910 --> 04:17:13,370
Climb.

4673
04:17:14,910 --> 04:17:15,370
Attaboy.

4674
04:17:21,840 --> 04:17:22,640
The guards are gone!

4675
04:17:24,320 --> 04:17:26,260
I knew there was something about the night.

4676
04:17:31,880 --> 04:17:32,340
Shit!

4677
04:17:34,760 --> 04:17:35,540
You don't see me.

4678
04:17:36,000 --> 04:17:37,560
Oh, shit!

4679
04:17:39,120 --> 04:17:39,580
Damn.

4680
04:17:41,920 --> 04:17:43,660
I guess they don't render until you're close enough.

4681
04:17:46,120 --> 04:17:46,880
Okay, okay.

4682
04:17:48,140 --> 04:17:51,160
Well, unfortunately, we just, uh...

4683
04:17:51,160 --> 04:17:52,140
made it morning again.

4684
04:17:52,360 --> 04:17:53,840
I kind of wanted to go back here during the night.

4685
04:17:56,940 --> 04:17:58,220
Where am I going to use that egg?

4686
04:17:59,320 --> 04:18:00,400
Maybe in the egg house.

4687
04:18:04,170 --> 04:18:05,450
Oh, wait, it is night.

4688
04:18:06,470 --> 04:18:07,230
Yo, someone's up there!

4689
04:18:12,120 --> 04:18:14,620
It seems like it's taken forever for dawn to come.

4690
04:18:15,860 --> 04:18:18,020
The view of Hyrule Castle in the morning...

4691
04:18:18,020 --> 04:18:19,760
sun is so fantastic.

4692
04:18:21,640 --> 04:18:22,860
I have news for you, sir.

4693
04:18:23,560 --> 04:18:24,860
It will take forever.

4694
04:18:25,300 --> 04:18:26,840
Because time doesn't move in here.

4695
04:18:28,300 --> 04:18:29,120
Look at all these dogs.

4696
04:18:29,280 --> 04:18:29,940
Oh, yeah, that is weird.

4697
04:18:30,040 --> 04:18:31,040
Why are there dogs down here?

4698
04:18:32,220 --> 04:18:33,140
That is weird.

4699
04:18:36,220 --> 04:18:37,940
We gotta get to the bottom of this mystery.

4700
04:18:39,400 --> 04:18:40,320
Do you like an egg?

4701
04:18:43,170 --> 04:18:44,250
It doesn't work here.

4702
04:18:45,950 --> 04:18:48,790
Why is there a little girl incubating an egg for me?

4703
04:18:49,750 --> 04:18:50,750
That's so weird.

4704
04:18:53,470 --> 04:18:56,330
Kids shouldn't be wandering around town at night time.

4705
04:18:56,810 --> 04:18:58,170
Stay indoors until morning.

4706
04:19:00,530 --> 04:19:02,050
I mean, I don't have a home.

4707
04:19:02,350 --> 04:19:02,830
Actually, I do.

4708
04:19:05,880 --> 04:19:06,820
Kids shouldn't be...

4709
04:19:06,820 --> 04:19:07,420
Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.

4710
04:19:07,540 --> 04:19:08,420
Whatever, whatever, dude.

4711
04:19:10,320 --> 04:19:12,200
Maybe we go to the temple during the night.

4712
04:19:16,450 --> 04:19:17,910
Is it scary during the night?

4713
04:19:30,660 --> 04:19:31,100
Okay.

4714
04:19:32,940 --> 04:19:33,960
Looks about the same.

4715
04:19:36,000 --> 04:19:37,160
Look at a symbol over there.

4716
04:19:38,700 --> 04:19:40,720
It's like a tower with an orb on top.

4717
04:19:40,720 --> 04:19:45,020
And a bunch of lines, like sun rays or something, shining out of it.

4718
04:19:48,240 --> 04:19:51,700
Also, that sure looks like a place someone died, doesn't it?

4719
04:19:52,420 --> 04:19:54,300
Like a sarcophagus or something right here?

4720
04:19:54,360 --> 04:19:54,780
What is this?

4721
04:19:55,340 --> 04:19:57,400
Oh, no, it's more like an engraving, right?

4722
04:19:57,860 --> 04:19:58,120
Yeah.

4723
04:19:59,300 --> 04:20:00,800
But someone could be buried here, I guess.

4724
04:20:11,470 --> 04:20:12,650
Man, you can see the...

4725
04:20:14,730 --> 04:20:15,990
mountain in the background there.

4726
04:20:18,130 --> 04:20:19,210
Oh, what was the name of that?

4727
04:20:19,850 --> 04:20:20,790
Gorog Mountain, right?

4728
04:20:22,810 --> 04:20:25,730
No, actually, was it Death Mountain or something like that?

4729
04:20:25,830 --> 04:20:27,010
It was something very sinister.

4730
04:20:29,770 --> 04:20:30,970
At least in Breath of the Wild.

4731
04:20:40,790 --> 04:20:41,930
Where am I going now?

4732
04:20:42,090 --> 04:20:43,370
Maybe back alleys during the night.

4733
04:20:45,650 --> 04:20:46,050
Also.

4734
04:20:53,890 --> 04:20:55,050
Treasure box shop.

4735
04:20:58,340 --> 04:20:59,960
Open the chest and...

4736
04:20:59,960 --> 04:21:00,380
Surprise!

4737
04:21:00,880 --> 04:21:02,860
If you find a key inside, you'll be able to advance.

4738
04:21:03,380 --> 04:21:04,100
Left or right?

4739
04:21:04,300 --> 04:21:04,700
Try your luck.

4740
04:21:06,460 --> 04:21:07,780
10 rupees to play.

4741
04:21:08,040 --> 04:21:08,680
Do you want to try it?

4742
04:21:10,200 --> 04:21:11,320
Does it involve aiming?

4743
04:21:13,200 --> 04:21:13,760
I'm down.

4744
04:21:16,300 --> 04:21:17,500
You got a door key.

4745
04:21:17,860 --> 04:21:19,700
Use this key to continue to the next room.

4746
04:21:19,860 --> 04:21:21,900
Select a treasure chest and see how lucky you are.

4747
04:21:25,320 --> 04:21:25,720
Okay.

4748
04:21:32,330 --> 04:21:33,430
I'm going to say left.

4749
04:21:37,810 --> 04:21:38,230
I'm going to say left.

4750
04:21:38,230 --> 04:21:39,150
You got a door key!

4751
04:21:40,530 --> 04:21:40,950
Nice.

4752
04:21:46,450 --> 04:21:47,430
Is there something in here?

4753
04:21:52,630 --> 04:21:53,790
I'm going to say left again.

4754
04:21:54,730 --> 04:21:55,670
No, I'm going to say right.

4755
04:22:00,640 --> 04:22:01,060
Shit!

4756
04:22:02,220 --> 04:22:02,640
Loser!

4757
04:22:03,820 --> 04:22:05,220
You found only one rupee.

4758
04:22:05,540 --> 04:22:06,260
You're not very lucky.

4759
04:22:07,200 --> 04:22:07,560
Damn!

4760
04:22:07,920 --> 04:22:09,280
Man, I should have gone with my gut instinct!

4761
04:22:11,400 --> 04:22:12,530
So I'm stuck here, or...?

4762
04:22:15,000 --> 04:22:15,420
Damn!

4763
04:22:18,440 --> 04:22:19,760
