04:55:00,650 --> 04:55:01,650
I'm here to garden.

5322
04:55:02,490 --> 04:55:03,470
I'm going this way.

5323
04:55:04,210 --> 04:55:04,450
No?

5324
04:55:04,630 --> 04:55:04,930
Okay.

5325
04:55:07,550 --> 04:55:07,950
Uh.

5326
04:55:08,830 --> 04:55:10,950
I don't want to get caught by you guys and get thrown out again.

5327
04:55:11,970 --> 04:55:12,990
Uh, let's go this way.

5328
04:55:14,350 --> 04:55:15,370
Nothing that way, eh?

5329
04:55:16,350 --> 04:55:17,510
Well, ain't that a bitch.

5330
04:55:17,690 --> 04:55:18,190
Alright, then.

5331
04:55:18,270 --> 04:55:18,730
You got me.

5332
04:55:21,330 --> 04:55:21,730
No!

5333
04:55:26,980 --> 04:55:27,380
Motherfucker!

5334
04:55:30,390 --> 04:55:30,790
Okay.

5335
04:55:31,410 --> 04:55:31,810
Well.

5336
04:55:33,090 --> 04:55:33,490
Shit.

5337
04:55:34,850 --> 04:55:39,010
I thought maybe since I'm already inside, they wouldn't apprehend me anymore and be like, Uh, who are you?

5338
04:55:39,170 --> 04:55:39,370
You know?

5339
04:55:39,450 --> 04:55:41,170
And I'll be like, I'm the gardener.

5340
04:55:41,330 --> 04:55:41,890
It's me.

5341
04:55:42,410 --> 04:55:43,670
Don't you see my green clothes?

5342
04:55:46,050 --> 04:55:46,910
Can I jump up here?

5343
04:55:49,840 --> 04:55:50,980
Bro, where am I supposed to go?

5344
04:55:52,680 --> 04:55:54,080
Can I change the camera angle?

5345
04:55:54,320 --> 04:55:54,980
Oh, oh, oh.

5346
04:55:55,200 --> 04:55:56,360
That was a disturbing sound.

5347
04:56:00,750 --> 04:56:02,110
Okay, let's sneak behind them.

5348
04:56:03,710 --> 04:56:04,790
Just like we did earlier.

5349
04:56:06,930 --> 04:56:07,970
You don't see me.

5350
04:56:08,110 --> 04:56:08,550
No!

5351
04:56:09,690 --> 04:56:10,570
You bastards.

5352
04:56:17,480 --> 04:56:18,580
Third time's the charm.

5353
04:56:19,440 --> 04:56:19,860
Up.

5354
04:56:22,120 --> 04:56:22,560
Jump!

5355
04:56:23,540 --> 04:56:24,360
No, Link!

5356
04:56:25,120 --> 04:56:26,200
What are you doing?

5357
04:56:27,660 --> 04:56:29,280
No, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no.

5358
04:56:29,320 --> 04:56:29,540
Oh, no.

5359
04:56:29,840 --> 04:56:30,580
The current is too strong.

5360
04:56:35,160 --> 04:56:35,800
Come on.

5361
04:56:36,580 --> 04:56:37,400
Up you go.

5362
04:56:38,140 --> 04:56:38,860
There we go.

5363
04:56:42,070 --> 04:56:42,510
Beautiful.

5364
04:56:45,900 --> 04:56:47,360
Now, do a nice jump.

5365
04:56:51,210 --> 04:56:52,750
Oh, it doesn't get much better than that.

5366
04:57:00,440 --> 04:57:01,640
Okay, so what do we do now?

5367
04:57:04,560 --> 04:57:05,400
Maybe the...

5368
04:57:05,400 --> 04:57:06,640
If we stay out...

5369
04:57:08,420 --> 04:57:09,800
I wasn't even on the screen!

5370
04:57:10,820 --> 04:57:11,240
Hello?

5371
04:57:15,010 --> 04:57:15,430
Motherfucker.

5372
04:57:17,630 --> 04:57:21,670
Dude, this is the hardest stealth section in any game I've ever played!

5373
04:57:22,450 --> 04:57:23,370
What the fuck?

5374
04:57:25,980 --> 04:57:27,920
I don't even see a clear path!

5375
04:57:31,540 --> 04:57:31,980
What?

5376
04:57:32,300 --> 04:57:32,740
Wait, what?

5377
04:57:36,970 --> 04:57:37,410
What?

5378
04:57:38,830 --> 04:57:40,070
Why is everyone gone now?

5379
04:57:46,030 --> 04:57:47,170
Oh, my goodness.

5380
04:57:50,380 --> 04:57:52,140
Alright, here at least I know what to do.

5381
04:57:55,560 --> 04:57:58,100
I guess they have set patrols during the day and night?

5382
04:57:59,860 --> 04:58:00,840
See ya, nerd.

5383
04:58:02,980 --> 04:58:03,900
Oh, my God.

5384
04:58:03,960 --> 04:58:04,940
This is so good!

5385
04:58:07,920 --> 04:58:08,800
Okay, go!

5386
04:58:13,240 --> 04:58:13,920
Beautiful!

5387
04:58:16,600 --> 04:58:18,200
Oh, my God!

5388
04:58:18,740 --> 04:58:21,620
They're teasing me with the little crystals!

5389
04:58:25,880 --> 04:58:26,960
I'm getting them.

5390
04:58:38,640 --> 04:58:39,420
Oh, no.

5391
04:58:39,480 --> 04:58:39,800
Stay over here.

5392
04:58:48,490 --> 04:58:49,170
Beautiful!

5393
04:58:50,110 --> 04:58:51,650
Okay, now we gotta wait a little bit.

5394
04:58:59,370 --> 04:59:00,790
Hey, this is great!

5395
04:59:01,770 --> 04:59:03,110
Really liking this.

5396
04:59:05,630 --> 04:59:07,230
What is that statue of?

5397
04:59:07,610 --> 04:59:11,150
Looks like a person just slaying a bunch of innocents.

5398
04:59:12,530 --> 04:59:13,810
Who are running for their lives.

5399
04:59:15,390 --> 04:59:16,950
Why would they have that statue here?

5400
04:59:18,570 --> 04:59:19,210
Ah, wait a minute.

5401
04:59:19,470 --> 04:59:20,350
There's the, uh...

5402
04:59:20,350 --> 04:59:21,310
Tri-symbol down below.

5403
04:59:22,550 --> 04:59:24,030
Maybe it's one of those goddesses.

5404
04:59:30,900 --> 04:59:31,820
Alright, move, move, move.

5405
04:59:32,800 --> 04:59:33,840
I gotta wait a little bit.

5406
04:59:35,880 --> 04:59:37,060
They need to be on the other side.

5407
04:59:37,980 --> 04:59:38,460
Oh, shit.

5408
04:59:38,520 --> 04:59:39,300
Don't come this way, please.

5409
04:59:48,190 --> 04:59:49,390
I think I can go here now.

5410
04:59:52,910 --> 04:59:53,310
Move.

5411
04:59:54,190 --> 04:59:54,970
Psst, go.

5412
04:59:56,070 --> 04:59:56,470
Yes.

5413
05:00:01,470 --> 05:00:02,590
This feels wrong.

5414
05:00:04,930 --> 05:00:05,330
RUT!

5415
05:00:06,950 --> 05:00:07,350
Alright!

5416
05:00:12,270 --> 05:00:12,810
Wait a minute.

5417
05:00:12,870 --> 05:00:14,110
Do I need to stay on grass or something?

5418
05:00:16,890 --> 05:00:18,150
Oh, I think we may be good here.

5419
05:00:18,230 --> 05:00:18,790
Is that Aristotle?

5420
05:00:24,680 --> 05:00:25,200
Made it.

5421
05:00:31,240 --> 05:00:31,640
Yeah.

5422
05:00:35,680 --> 05:00:37,060
Castle Courtyard.

5423
05:00:37,500 --> 05:00:38,620
Is that her?

5424
05:00:42,040 --> 05:00:42,800
Dude.

5425
05:00:48,000 --> 05:00:49,620
I think that's Zelda.

5426
05:01:06,260 --> 05:01:06,600
Hmm.

5427
05:01:07,060 --> 05:01:08,240
There's things inside there.

5428
05:01:13,600 --> 05:01:14,320
Hey, Zelda!

5429
05:01:14,820 --> 05:01:15,820
What's going on?

5430
05:01:24,110 --> 05:01:25,450
We're calling it here.

5431
05:01:26,850 --> 05:01:27,610
That's...

5432
05:01:27,610 --> 05:01:28,890
The perfect cliffhanger.

5433
05:01:29,890 --> 05:01:31,650
The perfect cliffhanger.

5434
05:01:31,990 --> 05:01:33,850
Next time we're gonna greet Zelda.

5435
05:01:36,530 --> 05:01:37,650
That's right, Link.

5436
05:01:37,870 --> 05:01:38,410
Fall asleep.

5437
05:01:39,930 --> 05:01:41,010
It's been a long day.

5438
05:01:41,390 --> 05:01:42,050
And night.

5439
05:01:42,170 --> 05:01:42,570
And day.

5440
05:01:42,690 --> 05:01:43,330
And night again.

5441
05:01:43,470 --> 05:01:43,930
And day and night.

5442
05:01:44,050 --> 05:01:45,730
It's been a couple weeks, actually.

5443
05:01:45,950 --> 05:01:46,750
But we made it.

5444
05:01:54,510 --> 05:01:56,150
That was a good spot to end.

5445
05:01:57,470 --> 05:01:57,910
Lovely.

5446
05:02:01,380 --> 05:02:02,120
Oh, man.

5447
05:02:03,840 --> 05:02:04,520
Oh, man.

5448
05:02:08,020 --> 05:02:08,460
Oh.

5449
05:02:09,020 --> 05:02:10,740
That was actually pretty good.

5450
05:02:12,860 --> 05:02:15,120
I had more fun with this than I thought I would have.

5451
05:02:16,080 --> 05:02:16,800
I'm not gonna lie.

5452
05:02:16,960 --> 05:02:17,820
This was great.

5453
05:02:18,280 --> 05:02:20,500
Like, I understand why you guys are liking this.

5454
05:02:22,360 --> 05:02:24,820
I don't know how far I am in the game, though, but...

5455
05:02:25,280 --> 05:02:27,420
It still feels like the tutorial in a weird way.

5456
05:02:30,760 --> 05:02:31,440
Enjoying it so far?

5457
05:02:31,520 --> 05:02:32,300
I am enjoying it.

5458
05:02:32,420 --> 05:02:33,140
I'm having a blast.

5459
05:02:34,460 --> 05:02:36,220
Definitely tougher than expected, yes.

5460
05:02:36,960 --> 05:02:39,060
But honestly, I was kind of expecting that.

5461
05:02:39,980 --> 05:02:42,760
Old games have a bit of a weird quirkiness to them, right?

5462
05:02:46,180 --> 05:02:47,100
Totally, uh...

5463
05:02:47,100 --> 05:02:47,780
To be expected.

5464
05:02:49,480 --> 05:02:51,100
Do you have the roast in the glasses?

5465
05:02:51,280 --> 05:02:51,580
I...

5466
05:02:51,580 --> 05:02:51,720
No.

5467
05:02:52,600 --> 05:02:54,060
You're getting the full...

5468
05:02:54,060 --> 05:02:56,900
Unfiltered experience of someone who's never played it before.

5469
05:02:57,400 --> 05:02:59,380
And I'm 33 years old, I think.

5470
05:03:00,300 --> 05:03:01,140
Maybe 34.

5471
05:03:01,380 --> 05:03:01,900
No, 33.

5472
05:03:04,220 --> 05:03:04,700
4092.

5473
05:03:04,940 --> 05:03:05,320
Do the math.

5474
05:03:07,340 --> 05:03:09,080
Least favorite part about the game so far?

5475
05:03:09,160 --> 05:03:09,760
The input lag.

5476
05:03:10,220 --> 05:03:11,560
Honestly, I don't really...

5477
05:03:12,260 --> 05:03:13,340
Mind anything about the game.

5478
05:03:13,960 --> 05:03:15,260
It's just the input lag.

5479
05:03:15,520 --> 05:03:16,460
It's really, really bad.

5480
05:03:17,180 --> 05:03:19,200
Like, during the aiming challenge?

5481
05:03:19,200 --> 05:03:20,900
You have no idea how hard that is.

5482
05:03:21,600 --> 05:03:23,220
It feels like half a second.

5483
05:03:23,440 --> 05:03:24,080
Probably not.

5484
05:03:24,880 --> 05:03:27,240
Maybe 250 milliseconds or something like that.

5485
05:03:27,340 --> 05:03:28,620
It's really bad.

5486
05:03:34,140 --> 05:03:35,300
It's worse on the Switch?

5487
05:03:35,300 --> 05:03:36,200
Oh, really?

5488
05:03:36,680 --> 05:03:38,440
I guess it's being emulated, right?

5489
05:03:38,520 --> 05:03:40,160
That adds a little bit of...

5490
05:03:40,160 --> 05:03:41,800
Uh, delay down the chain.

5491
05:03:45,580 --> 05:03:49,380
But honestly, walking around and all that and fighting is not too bad with the input lag.

5492
05:03:49,540 --> 05:03:51,060
That's something I have gotten used to.

5493
05:03:51,800 --> 05:03:53,600
And the combat is not that difficult.

5494
05:03:53,880 --> 05:03:55,860
That's, you know, I don't have a big problem with it.

5495
05:03:59,250 --> 05:04:00,910
But I definitely, uh...

5496
05:04:00,910 --> 05:04:02,690
The game itself, I have no complaints about.

5497
05:04:02,950 --> 05:04:03,690
The game is fun.

5498
05:04:08,490 --> 05:04:10,410
There isn't any delay in the 3DS version.

5499
05:04:10,530 --> 05:04:13,110
But isn't 3DS the kind of console where you have two screens?

5500
05:04:13,510 --> 05:04:15,090
And how would you even stream that, right?

5501
05:04:15,230 --> 05:04:16,270
Like, how does that even work?

5502
05:04:21,760 --> 05:04:25,800
Play Ship of Harkinian for native PC gameplay?

5503
05:04:26,380 --> 05:04:27,220
What is that?

5504
05:04:29,080 --> 05:04:31,280
Also, I'm not sure I'm allowed to do that.

5505
05:04:31,520 --> 05:04:35,700
If it's some kind of independent made game.

5506
05:04:36,180 --> 05:04:37,460
Not endorsed by Nintendo.

5507
05:04:39,980 --> 05:04:40,880
3DS is a remake.

5508
05:04:41,160 --> 05:04:41,680
It's pretty different.

5509
05:04:41,840 --> 05:04:42,460
Oh, really?

5510
05:04:42,580 --> 05:04:43,840
I didn't realize the game had a remake.

5511
05:04:44,900 --> 05:04:45,640
What the fuck?

5512
05:04:49,590 --> 05:04:50,990
A 3DS capture card.

5513
05:04:52,110 --> 05:04:53,450
I do have a capture card.

5514
05:04:53,550 --> 05:04:55,110
That's how I'm playing, uh, this right now.

5515
05:04:55,950 --> 05:04:57,430
But do you need a specific one for that?

5516
05:04:57,530 --> 05:04:58,170
I mean, it doesn't matter.

5517
05:04:58,230 --> 05:04:59,150
I'm gonna play it on this one.

5518
05:05:04,960 --> 05:05:06,820
You can play it if you domp your own ROM.

5519
05:05:06,960 --> 05:05:08,060
I don't know how to do that.

5520
05:05:09,080 --> 05:05:10,520
But I guess there's guides online.

5521
05:05:14,640 --> 05:05:17,000
It's a Ocarina of Time decompilation.

5522
05:05:17,900 --> 05:05:18,300
Okay.

5523
05:05:20,060 --> 05:05:21,240
I'm not colorblind.

5524
05:05:22,200 --> 05:05:23,300
At least I don't think so.

5525
05:05:23,380 --> 05:05:24,920
I've never had any issues with colors.

5526
05:05:29,410 --> 05:05:30,770
I am half blind, though.

5527
05:05:30,950 --> 05:05:31,910
Meaning I use glasses.

5528
05:05:33,930 --> 05:05:35,670
I am, uh, nearsighted.

5529
05:05:36,650 --> 05:05:37,550
Is that what it's called?

5530
05:05:37,550 --> 05:05:39,470
When you can see things up close but not far away.

5531
05:05:52,300 --> 05:05:54,000
I mean, I already paid for the...

5532
05:05:54,000 --> 05:05:57,140
Guys, I had to pay, like, 300 kroners.

5533
05:05:57,140 --> 05:06:01,060
Because you could only buy a year of the Nintendo Switch Online thing.

5534
05:06:01,620 --> 05:06:03,120
You can't buy month by month.

5535
05:06:03,580 --> 05:06:06,020
So I paid 300 kroners, which is...

5536
05:06:06,480 --> 05:06:07,220
What is that?

5537
05:06:08,420 --> 05:06:08,820
Like...

5538
05:06:08,820 --> 05:06:10,340
$50 or something?

5539
05:06:10,520 --> 05:06:10,880
$40?

5540
05:06:11,280 --> 05:06:11,820
Something like that?

5541
05:06:12,620 --> 05:06:15,040
I'm not sure what the conversion rate is right now.

5542
05:06:21,200 --> 05:06:21,980
I'm gonna have to go.

5543
05:06:22,120 --> 05:06:22,640
See you all on the fun.

5544
05:06:22,760 --> 05:06:23,680
Yeah, you too, Lord Eternal.

5545
05:06:24,640 --> 05:06:25,580
Thanks for checking it out.

5546
05:06:26,840 --> 05:06:28,540
Anything planned for a 100k special?

5547
05:06:28,540 --> 05:06:30,500
I don't really have anything for that.

5548
05:06:34,500 --> 05:06:36,120
I mean, it is a crazy milestone.

5549
05:06:37,220 --> 05:06:38,660
But it is just a number, right?

5550
05:06:38,760 --> 05:06:39,520
Like any other number.

5551
05:06:41,740 --> 05:06:42,800
Yeah, stream is ending.

5552
05:06:48,640 --> 05:06:50,660
In the US, it's $60 per year?

5553
05:06:50,780 --> 05:06:50,960
Damn.

5554
05:06:51,580 --> 05:06:52,340
That's crazy.

5555
05:06:52,820 --> 05:06:55,960
But you also get access to other types of emulators, right?

5556
05:06:57,840 --> 05:06:58,600
Nintendo and...

5557
05:06:58,600 --> 05:07:00,240
Maybe some of the older ones.

5558
05:07:00,400 --> 05:07:01,620
And also GameCube, I think?

5559
05:07:02,200 --> 05:07:02,940
Something like that?

5560
05:07:09,970 --> 05:07:12,430
We need a sequel to I invented the knife for 100k.

5561
05:07:14,070 --> 05:07:14,710
Here's the thing.

5562
05:07:14,990 --> 05:07:17,910
Those types of videos are just gonna come when I feel like making one, right?

5563
05:07:20,230 --> 05:07:22,510
Sometimes it happens a lot and I, you know...

5564
05:07:22,510 --> 05:07:24,330
I'm bored and I make up shit.

5565
05:07:25,670 --> 05:07:26,050
But...

5566
05:07:26,050 --> 05:07:26,570
Yeah.

5567
05:07:27,210 --> 05:07:28,630
I don't know when that's gonna happen.

5568
05:07:34,830 --> 05:07:36,950
The expansion pack is...

5569
05:07:37,790 --> 05:07:40,350
Well, that's what I paid 300k for, but...

5570
05:07:40,350 --> 05:07:43,230
I'm on a 7-day trial for the Nintendo Online part, I think.

5571
05:07:44,010 --> 05:07:46,190
I'm not sure what that's gonna cost after that, actually.

5572
05:07:49,190 --> 05:07:50,810
Yeah, you can't invent the knife every day.

5573
05:07:51,610 --> 05:07:52,530
Too much work.

5574
05:07:53,790 --> 05:07:55,990
Man, I love this music so much.

5575
05:07:56,930 --> 05:08:00,090
Dude, the Blueprint soundtrack is just immaculate.

5576
05:08:00,410 --> 05:08:01,510
It's so good.

5577
05:08:02,510 --> 05:08:03,270
Holy shit.

5578
05:08:09,340 --> 05:08:11,900
It just makes me so relaxed.

5579
05:08:14,240 --> 05:08:15,920
I wanna sit on a porch, you know?

5580
05:08:17,000 --> 05:08:18,060
With a wine.

5581
05:08:19,360 --> 05:08:21,940
Bottle of wine and just hang out in the sun.

5582
05:08:23,180 --> 05:08:24,900
Feeling that breeze in my hair.

5583
05:08:26,360 --> 05:08:27,820
Looking at horses running.

5584
05:08:28,600 --> 05:08:29,200
You know?

5585
05:08:30,020 --> 05:08:31,040
In the distance.

5586
05:08:31,500 --> 05:08:31,840
Oh, yeah.

5587
05:08:36,280 --> 05:08:38,740
Oliver, make sure to do quicksafes on the NSO.

5588
05:08:38,740 --> 05:08:39,340
Oh, okay.

5589
05:08:40,160 --> 05:08:40,980
Uh, hold on.

5590
05:08:43,380 --> 05:08:45,000
Do you mean create suspend point?

5591
05:08:45,160 --> 05:08:45,880
Because I can do that.

5592
05:08:47,520 --> 05:08:48,420
What is the difference?

5593
05:08:48,760 --> 05:08:49,640
Did I not save the game?

